destination code from analysis documents, supporting OpenAPI specifications and Standard Analysis Format.","zh":"implement-destination是 Segment 行动目的地代码生成器，用于根据分析文档生成代码","ja":"implement-destinationは、Segmentアクション目的地コード生成ツールであり、分析ドキュメントからコードを生成するために使用されます","ko":"implement-destination은 Segment 액션 대상 코드 생성기로서 분석 문서에서 코드를 생성하는 데 사용됩니다","es":"Implement-destination es un skill que genera código de destino de acción completo en Segment desde documentos de análisis.","fr":"Implement-destination est un skill qui génère du code de destination d''action complet sur Segment à partir de documents d''analyse.","de":"Implement-destination ist ein Skill, der vollständigen Aktionszielcode in Segment aus Analysedokumenten generiert.","pt":"O que é Implement-Destination? É uma ferramenta que gera código para Segment a partir de documentos de análise","ru":"Что такое Implement-Destination? Это инструмент, который генерирует код для Segment из документов анализа","ar":"ما هو Implement-Destination؟ إنه أداة تولد كود للقسم من وثائق التحليل"},"features":{"en":["Generates complete Segment action-destination code from analysis documents","Supports OpenAPI specifications via /openapi-analyze","Analyzes website documentation via /web-analyze","Works with any analysis document following the Standard Analysis Format","Requires analysis documents to follow the format defined in .claude/skills/implement-destination/analysis-format.md"],"zh":["支持OpenAPI规范","支持网站文档","支持标准分析格式","根据分析文档生成代码","支持用户选择的操作","生成完整的Segment行动目的地代码"],"ja":["OpenAPI仕様をサポート","Webサイトドキュメントをサポート","標準分析形式をサポート","分析ドキュメントからコードを生成","ユーザー選択のアクションをサポート","完全なSegmentアクション目的地コードを生成"],"ko":["OpenAPI 사양 지원","웹 사이트 문서 지원","표준 분석 형식 지원","분석 문서에서 코드 생성","사용자 선택 동작 지원","완전한 Segment 액션 대상 코드 생성"],"es":["Soporte para especificaciones OpenAPI","Análisis de documentación web","Compatibilidad con el formato de análisis estándar","Generación de código de destino de acción completo","Integración con Segment"],"fr":["Prise en charge des spécifications OpenAPI","Analyse de la documentation web","Compatibilité avec le format d''analyse standard","Génération de code de destination d''action complet","Intégration avec Segment"],"de":["Unterstützung für OpenAPI-Spezifikationen","Analyse von Webdokumentation","Kompatibilität mit dem Standardanalyseformat","Erstellung von vollständigem Aktionszielcode","Integration mit Segment"],"pt":["Geração de código completo para Segment a partir de documentos de análise","Suporte a OpenAPI specifications (via /openapi-analyze)","Suporte a website documentation (via /web-analyze)","Suporte a documentos de análise no formato Standard Analysis Format","Integração com a plataforma Segment para criar destinos de streaming personalizados"],"ru":["Генерация полного кода для Segment из документов анализа","Поддержка OpenAPI specifications (via /openapi-analyze)","Поддержка website documentation (via /web-analyze)","Поддержка документов анализа в формате Standard Analysis Format","Интеграция с платформой Segment для создания индивидуальных потоковых назначений"],"ar":["توليد كود كامل للقسم من وثائق التحليل","دعم مواصفات OpenAPI (من خلال /openapi-analyze)","دعم توثيق الموقع الإلكتروني (من خلال /web-analyze)","دعم وثائق التحليل بالتنسيق المعياري للتحليل","التكامل مع منصة القسم لإنشاء وجهات بث مخصصة"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use implement-destination","implement-destination setup guide","what is implement-destination","implement-destination alternative","implement-destination vs Segment","implement-destination install","OpenAPI specifications","Standard Analysis Format"],"zh":["AI工具","Segment行动目的地","代码生成器","OpenAPI规范","网站文档","标准分析格式","实现目标","代码生成","AIエージェント"],"ja":["AIエージェント","Segmentアクション目的地","コード生成ツール","OpenAPI仕様","Webサイトドキュメント","標準分析形式","目的地の実装","コード生成","AIツール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","Segment 액션 대상","코드 생성기","OpenAPI 사양","웹 사이트 문서","표준 분석 형식","대상 구현","코드 생성","AI 도구"],"es":["implement-destination","Segment","destinos de streaming","código de destino de acción","análisis de documentos","OpenAPI","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agentes"],"fr":["implement-destination","Segment","destinations de streaming","code de destination d''action","analyse de documents","OpenAPI","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","Outils d''IA"],"de":["implement-destination","Segment","Streaming-Ziele","Aktionszielcode","Analyse von Dokumenten","OpenAPI","Softwareentwicklung","Entwicklungstools","KI-Tools"],"pt":["Implement-Destination","Desenvolvimento de destinos de streaming","Geração de código para Segment","OpenAPI specifications","Website documentation","Standard Analysis Format","Plataforma Segment","Desenvolvedores de software","Ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Implement-Destination","Разработка потоковых назначений","Генерация кода для Segment","OpenAPI specifications","Website documentation","Standard Analysis Format","Платформа Segment","Разработчики программного обеспечения","Инструменты разработки"],"ar":["Implement-Destination","تطوير وجهات البث","توليد كود للقسم","مواصفات OpenAPI","توثيق الموقع الإلكتروني","تنسيق التحليل المعياري","منصة القسم","مطورو البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير"]}},"owner":"segmentio","repo":"action-destinations","repoPath":"segmentio/action-destinations","stars":80,"forks":305,"updatedAt":"2026-03-06T07:16:24Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"implement-destination","description":"Generate destination code from analysis documents (OpenAPI or web-based) and user-selected actions","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Destination Implementation Generator\n\nThis skill generates complete Segment action-destination code from analysis documents and user-selected actions.\n\n**Supported Analysis Sources:**\n\n- OpenAPI specifications (via `/openapi-analyze`)\n- Website documentation (via `/web-analyze`)\n- Any analysis document following the Standard Analysis Format\n\nAll analysis documents must follow the format defined in `.claude/skills/implement-destination/analysis-format.md`.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather I","body":"# Destination Implementation Generator\n\nThis skill generates complete Segment action-destination code from analysis documents and user-selected actions.\n\n**Supported Analysis Sources:**\n\n- OpenAPI specifications (via `/openapi-analyze`)\n- Website documentation (via `/web-analyze`)\n- Any analysis document following the Standard Analysis Format\n\nAll analysis documents must follow the format defined in `.claude/skills/implement-destination/analysis-format.md`.\n\n## Instructions\n\n### Step 1: Gather Inputs\n\nAsk the user for the following information:\n\n1. **Analysis Document Path** - Path to the analysis markdown file (should be in `packages/destination-actions/.claude/openapi-analyses/`)\n2. **Destination Name** - Human-readable name (e.g., \"Acme Marketing\", \"Braze\")\n3. **Destination Slug** - Auto-suggest based on name (e.g., \"acme-marketing\" from \"Acme Marketing\")\n   - Remove \"actions-\" prefix if user includes it - this is added automatically to the path\n   - Use lowercase, hyphens instead of spaces\n4. **Selected Actions** - Comma-separated list of action names to implement (from the analysis doc)\n\n### Step 2: Parse Analysis Document\n\nRead the analysis markdown file and extract:\n\n- API name, version, base URL\n- Authentication scheme and required fields\n- Test authentication endpoint\n- Selected action specifications:\n  - Endpoint path and method\n  - Operation ID\n  - Description\n  - Field mappings table\n  - Request body schema\n  - Batch support\n  - Default subscription\n\n### Step 3: Create Destination Structure\n\nCreate the following directory structure:\n\n```\npackages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/\n├── index.ts                    # Destination definition\n├── generated-types.ts          # Placeholder (auto-generated later)\n├── [action-1]/\n│   ├── index.ts               # Action definition\n│   ├── generated-types.ts     # Placeholder\n│   └── __tests__/\n│       └── index.test.ts      # Basic test\n├── [action-2]/\n│   └── ... (same structure)\n└── __tests__/\n    └── index.test.ts          # Destination test\n```\n\n### Step 4: Generate Destination index.ts\n\nRead the template at `.claude/skills/implement-destination/templates/destination-index.md` and customize it with:\n\n- Destination name and slug\n- Description from OpenAPI\n- Authentication scheme and fields\n- Test authentication endpoint (or TODO if not found)\n- Import statements for all selected actions\n- extendRequest implementation with proper headers\n- Regional endpoint handling if applicable\n\n**Authentication Scheme Templates:**\n\n**Custom (API Key in Header):**\n\n```typescript\nauthentication: {\n  scheme: ''custom'',\n  fields: {\n    apiKey: {\n      label: ''API Key'',\n      description: ''Your [API Name] API key'',\n      type: ''password'',\n      required: true\n    }\n  },\n  testAuthentication: (request, { settings }) => {\n    return request(''[TEST_ENDPOINT]'', {\n      method: ''GET''\n    })\n  }\n},\n\nextendRequest({ settings }) {\n  return {\n    headers: {\n      Authorization: `Bearer ${settings.apiKey}`,\n      ''Content-Type'': ''application/json''\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Basic Auth:**\n\n```typescript\nauthentication: {\n  scheme: ''basic'',\n  fields: {\n    username: {\n      label: ''Username'',\n      description: ''Your [API Name] username'',\n      type: ''string'',\n      required: true\n    },\n    password: {\n      label: ''Password'',\n      description: ''Your [API Name] password'',\n      type: ''password'',\n      required: true\n    }\n  },\n  testAuthentication: (request) => {\n    return request(''[TEST_ENDPOINT]'', {\n      method: ''GET''\n    })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**OAuth2 Managed:**\n\n```typescript\nauthentication: {\n  scheme: ''oauth-managed'',\n  fields: {\n    // No additional fields needed for managed OAuth\n  },\n  testAuthentication: (request) => {\n    return request(''[TEST_ENDPOINT]'', {\n      method: ''GET''\n    })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Step 5: Generate Action Files\n\nFor each selected action, generate three files:\n\n#### 5.1: Action index.ts\n\nRead the template at `.claude/skills/implement-destination/templates/action-index.md` and customize with:\n\n- Action title and description\n- Default subscription from analysis\n- Fields from the field mappings table:\n  - Convert each field to an InputField definition\n  - Set type, label, description, required\n  - Add default path where suggested\n  - Handle special types (objects, arrays, datetime)\n- Perform function with request to API endpoint\n- PerformBatch function if batch is supported\n\n**Field Type Conversions:**\n\n```typescript\n// String field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''string'',\n  required: [true|false],\n  default: { ''@path'': ''$.path.to.field'' }\n}\n\n// Integer/Number field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''integer'', // or ''number''\n  required: [true|false]\n}\n\n// Boolean field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''boolean'',\n  required: [true|false],\n  default: false\n}\n\n// Object field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''object'',\n  required: [true|false],\n  properties: {\n    nestedField: {\n      label: ''[Nested Label]'',\n      type: ''string''\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n// Array field (multiple values)\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''string'', // or object\n  multiple: true,\n  required: [true|false]\n}\n\n// Datetime field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''datetime'',\n  required: [true|false],\n  default: { ''@path'': ''$.timestamp'' }\n}\n\n// Enum field\nfieldName: {\n  label: ''[Label]'',\n  description: ''[Description]'',\n  type: ''string'',\n  required: [true|false],\n  choices: [\n    { label: ''Option 1'', value: ''option1'' },\n    { label: ''Option 2'', value: ''option2'' }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Perform Function Template:**\n\n```typescript\nperform: (request, { payload, settings }) => {\n  return request(''[API_ENDPOINT]'', {\n    method: ''[POST|PUT|PATCH]'',\n    json: {\n      // Map payload fields to API fields\n      [apiField]: payload.[segmentField],\n      // ... more mappings\n    }\n  })\n}\n```\n\n**PerformBatch Function Template (if supported):**\n\n```typescript\nperformBatch: (request, { payload, settings }) => {\n  return request(''[API_ENDPOINT]'', {\n    method: ''POST'',\n    json: payload.map(event => ({\n      [apiField]: event.[segmentField],\n      // ... more mappings\n    }))\n  })\n}\n```\n\n#### 5.2: Action generated-types.ts\n\nCreate placeholder file:\n\n```typescript\n// This file is generated automatically by the CLI\n// Run: ./bin/run generate:types --path packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/index.ts\n\nexport interface Payload {\n  // Types will be generated from the action definition\n}\n```\n\n#### 5.3: Action Test File\n\nRead the template at `.claude/skills/implement-destination/templates/test-template.md` and customize with:\n\n- Action name\n- Event type (track/identify/group)\n- Sample event data\n- Field mappings for test\n- Assertions\n\n### Step 6: Generate Destination-Level Files\n\n#### 6.1: Destination generated-types.ts\n\n```typescript\n// This file is generated automatically by the CLI\n// Run: ./bin/run generate:types --path packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/index.ts\n\nexport interface Settings {\n  // Types will be generated from the destination definition\n}\n```\n\n#### 6.2: Destination Test File\n\n```typescript\nimport { createTestIntegration } from ''@segment/actions-core''\nimport Destination from ''../index''\n\nconst testDestination = createTestIntegration(Destination)\n\ndescribe(''[Destination Name]'', () => {\n  describe(''testAuthentication'', () => {\n    it(''should validate authentication inputs'', async () => {\n      const authData = { [authField]: ''test_value'' }\n      await expect(testDestination.testAuthentication(authData)).resolves.not.toThrowError()\n    })\n  })\n})\n```\n\n### Step 7: Generate TypeScript Types\n\nRun the CLI command to generate proper types:\n\n```bash\n./bin/run generate:types --path packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/index.ts\n```\n\n### Step 8: Create Implementation Notes\n\nGenerate a markdown file at `packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md`:\n\n````markdown\n# [Destination Name] Implementation Notes\n\n**Generated:** [date]\n**From OpenAPI Analysis:** [analysis file path]\n\n## Summary\n\nThis destination was generated from an OpenAPI specification analysis. The generated code provides ~70-80% of the implementation with clear TODOs for completion.\n\n## Generated Files\n\n- `index.ts` - Destination definition with [auth-type] authentication\n  [For each action:]\n- `[action-name]/index.ts` - [Action description]\n- `[action-name]/__tests__/index.test.ts` - Basic test for [action-name]\n\n## TODO: Required Completions\n\n### 1. Authentication\n\n- [ ] Test `testAuthentication` with real API credentials\n- [ ] Verify `extendRequest` headers are correct for API\n- [ ] Confirm authentication error handling works\n\n### 2. Actions\n\n[For each action:]\n\n- [ ] **[Action Name]:**\n  - [ ] Review field mappings accuracy\n  - [ ] Customize request body transformation if needed\n  - [ ] Add error handling for API-specific errors\n  - [ ] Test with real API (credentials required)\n\n### 3. Testing\n\n- [ ] Add comprehensive unit tests with mock API responses\n- [ ] Test error scenarios (network errors, API errors, validation errors)\n- [ ] Test batch operations (if applicable)\n- [ ] Add integration tests\n\n### 4. Documentation\n\n- [ ] Update field descriptions with user-friendly language\n- [ ] Add examples for complex fields\n- [ ] Document any prerequisites or setup steps\n- [ ] Add troubleshooting notes\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Build and verify types:**\n   ```bash\n   ./bin/run generate:types --path packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/index.ts\n   yarn build\n   ```\n````\n\n2. **Run tests:**\n\n   ```bash\n   yarn test packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]\n   ```\n\n3. **Fix TypeScript errors** (if any)\n\n4. **Complete TODO items** above\n\n5. **Test with real API:**\n\n   - Obtain test credentials\n   - Configure destination in local development\n   - Send test events\n   - Verify API receives correct data\n\n6. **Code review and polish:**\n   - Review generated code for any OpenAPI-specific quirks\n   - Add any missing edge case handling\n   - Ensure error messages are helpful\n\n## Known Limitations of Generated Code\n\n- **Error handling:** Generic errors are thrown - customize for API-specific error codes\n- **Complex schemas:** Nested objects may need manual refinement\n- **Dynamic fields:** Cannot auto-generate dynamic field implementations\n- **Rate limiting:** No automatic rate limit handling - add if needed\n- **Retries:** No retry logic - add if API recommends it\n\n## API Documentation\n\n- **Base URL:** [base URL]\n- **API Docs:** [link if available]\n- **Support:** [support contact if available]\n\n````\n\n### Step 9: Serve the Destination Locally\n\nAfter generating the code, run the destination locally so the user can test it immediately:\n\n```bash\n./bin/run serve packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]\n````\n\nThis starts a local HTTP server that exposes the destination''s actions as endpoints. The user can send test requests directly to verify the destination behaves as expected before completing the TODO items.\n\nIf the serve command fails (e.g., due to TypeScript errors), inform the user and suggest running `yarn build` first to surface compilation errors.\n\n### Step 10: Present Results\n\nShow the user a summary:\n\n```\n✓ Created destination: [Destination Name]\n✓ Location: packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/\n✓ Generated [N] actions:\n  - [action-1]: [one-line description]\n  - [action-2]: [one-line description]\n✓ Generated TypeScript type definitions\n✓ Created test files\n✓ Created IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md\n✓ Destination server started\n\nThe destination is now running locally. Send test requests to verify behavior.\n\nNext steps:\n1. Review generated code in packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]/\n2. Complete TODOs in IMPLEMENTATION_NOTES.md\n3. Run: yarn test packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]\n4. Test with real API credentials\n5. To restart the server: ./bin/run serve packages/destination-actions/src/destinations/[slug]\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n- Always generate well-formatted, idiomatic TypeScript\n- Follow existing destination patterns in the codebase\n- Use proper imports from ''@segment/actions-core''\n- Leave clear TODO comments for manual work\n- Ensure all files have proper error handling imports even if not fully implemented\n- Keep perform functions simple - map payload to API request\n- For complex transformations, add TODO comments explaining what''s needed\n\n```\n\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-06T13:00:40.563Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Developer Agents requiring automated Segment action-destination code generation for streaming destinations.","zh":"适合需要自动化 Segment 动作目标代码生成以用于流媒体目标的开发者代理。","ja":"ストリーミング先の自動化セグメント動作先コード生成を必要とする開発者エージェントに最適です。","ko":"스트리밍 대상에 대한 자동화 된 세그먼트 동작 대상 코드 생성을 필요로하는 개발자 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Desarrollador que requieren generación automática de código de destino de acción de Segment para destinos de streaming.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant une génération automatique de code de destination d''action de Segment pour les destinations de streaming.","de":"Ideal für Developer-Agents, die eine automatisierte Generierung von Segment-Aktionsziencode für Streaming-Ziele erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvedor que exigem geração automática de código de ação-destino de Segment para destinos de streaming.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов-разработчиков, требующих автоматизированного генерирования кода действия-назначения Segment для потоковых назначений.","ar":"مثالية لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إنشاء رمز العمل الوجهة التلقائي لوجهات البث."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate complete Segment action-destination code from OpenAPI specifications, website documentation, and Standard Analysis Format documents, utilizing protocols like OpenAPI and file formats defined in the Standard Analysis Format.","zh":"赋予代理生成来自 OpenAPI 规范、网站文档和标准分析格式文档的完整 Segment 动作目标代码的能力，利用 OpenAPI 等协议和标准分析格式中定义的文件格式。","ja":"OpenAPI仕様、Webサイトのドキュメント、標準分析フォーマットのドキュメントから、完全なセグメント動作先コードを生成するエージェントの能力を与え、OpenAPIなどのプロトコルと標準分析フォーマットで定義されたファイル形式を利用します。","ko":"OpenAPI 규격, 웹사이트 문서, 표준 분석 형식 문서에서 완전한 세그먼트 동작 대상 코드를 생성하는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, OpenAPI 등의 프로토콜과 표준 분석 형식에서 정의된 파일 형식을 활용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar código de destino de acción de Segment completo a partir de especificaciones de OpenAPI, documentación de sitios web y documentos de formato de análisis estándar, utilizando protocolos como OpenAPI y formatos de archivo definidos en el formato de análisis estándar.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer un code de destination d''action de Segment complet à partir de spécifications OpenAPI, de documentation de site Web et de documents de format d''analyse standard, en utilisant des protocoles comme OpenAPI et des formats de fichier définis dans le format d''analyse standard.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, vollständigen Segment-Aktionsziencode aus OpenAPI-Spezifikationen, Website-Dokumentation und Standardanalyseformat-Dokumenten zu generieren, indem Protokolle wie OpenAPI und in der Standardanalyseformat definierte Dateiformate verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar código completo de ação-destino do Segment a partir de especificações OpenAPI, documentação de site e documentos de formato de análise padrão, utilizando protocolos como OpenAPI e formatos de arquivo definidos no formato de análise padrão.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать полный код действия-назначения Segment из спецификаций OpenAPI, документации веб-сайта и документов формата стандартного анализа, используя протоколы như OpenAPI и форматы файлов, определенные в формате стандартного анализа.","ar":"تمكّن الوكيل من إنشاء رمز كامل للعمل الوجهة من مواصفات OpenAPI ووثائق الموقع ووثائق تنسيق التحليل المعتمد، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل OpenAPI وأنماط الملفات المحددة في تنسيق التحليل المعتمد."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating destination implementation for streaming services","Generating action-destination code from website documentation","Creating complete Segment action-destination code from OpenAPI specifications"],"zh":["自动化流媒体服务的目标实现","从网站文档生成动作目标代码","从 OpenAPI 规范创建完整的 Segment 动作目标代码"],"ja":["ストリーミングサービスに対する先の実装の自動化","Webサイトのドキュメントから動作先コードを生成する","OpenAPI仕様から完全なセグメント動作先コードを作成する"],"ko":["스트리밍 서비스에 대한 대상 구현 자동화","웹사이트 문서에서 동작 대상 코드 생성","OpenAPI 규격에서 완전한 세그먼트 동작 대상 코드 생성"],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de destino para servicios de streaming","Generar código de destino de acción desde la documentación del sitio web","Crear código de destino de acción de Segment completo desde especificaciones de OpenAPI"],"fr":["Automatiser la mise en œuvre de la destination pour les services de streaming","Générer le code de destination d''action à partir de la documentation du site Web","Créer un code de destination d''action de Segment complet à partir de spécifications OpenAPI"],"de":["Automatisieren der Zielimplementierung für Streaming-Dienste","Erzeugen von Aktionsziencode aus der Website-Dokumentation","Erstellen von vollständigem Segment-Aktionsziencode aus OpenAPI-Spezifikationen"],"pt":["Automatizar a implementação de destino para serviços de streaming","Gerar código de ação-destino a partir da documentação do site","Criar código completo de ação-destino do Segment a partir de especificações OpenAPI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать реализацию назначения для потоковых сервисов","Генерировать код действия-назначения из документации веб-сайта","Создавать полный код действия-назначения Segment из спецификаций OpenAPI"],"ar":["توفير تنفيذ الوجهة تلقائيًا لخدمات البث","إنشاء رمز العمل الوجهة من وثائق الموقع","إنشاء رمز كامل للعمل الوجهة من مواصفات OpenAPI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires analysis documents in Standard Analysis Format","Limited to OpenAPI specifications and website documentation as analysis sources"],"zh":["需要标准分析格式的分析文档","仅限于 OpenAPI 规范和网站文档作为分析来源"],"ja":["標準分析フォーマットの分析ドキュメントが必要","分析ソースとしてはOpenAPI仕様とWebサイトのドキュメントのみに限定される"],"ko":["표준 분석 형식의 분석 문서가 필요함","분석 소스로 OpenAPI 규격과 웹사이트 문서만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere documentos de análisis en formato de análisis estándar","Limitado a especificaciones de OpenAPI y documentación de sitios web como fuentes de análisis"],"fr":["Nécessite des documents d''analyse au format d''analyse standard","Limité aux spécifications OpenAPI et à la documentation de site Web en tant que sources d''analyse"],"de":["Benötigt Analyse-Dokumente im Standardanalyseformat","Begrenzt auf OpenAPI-Spezifikationen und Website-Dokumentation als Analysequellen"],"pt":["Exige documentos de análise no Formato de Análise Padrão","Limitado a especificações OpenAPI e documentação do site como fontes de análise"],"ru":["Требует документов анализа в формате стандартного анализа","Ограничен спецификациями OpenAPI и документацией веб-сайта в качестве источников анализа"],"ar":["يتطلب وثائق تحليل بالتنسيق القياسي للتحليل","محدود بمواصفات OpenAPI ووثائق الموقع كمصادر للتحليل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"4daa514558345b2aa2a87fec00168434b53108fa5671271144e53dca2f3aab0e","qualityScore":70}');
