إبداعية","آلات دعم إلكتروني","agent zero","skil.md","إنشاء مهارات","أنماط الاستدعاء","هيكل المحتوى","ملفات دعم","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"agent0ai","repo":"agent-zero","repoPath":"agent0ai/agent-zero","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.274Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-skill","description":"Wizard for creating new Agent Zero skills. Guides users through creating well-structured SKILL.md files. Use when users want to create custom skills.","version":"1.0.0","tags":["meta","wizard","creation","tutorial","skills"],"bodyPreview":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatt","body":"# Create Skill Wizard\n\nThis skill helps you create new Agent Zero skills that follow the SKILL.md standard.\n\n## Quick Start\n\nTo create a new skill, I''ll guide you through these steps:\n\n1. **Name & Purpose** - What should this skill do?\n2. **Trigger Patterns** - When should this skill activate?\n3. **Content Structure** - What instructions should the agent follow?\n4. **Supporting Files** - Any scripts or templates needed?\n\n## SKILL.md Format\n\nEvery skill needs a `SKILL.md` file with YAML frontmatter:\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"skill-name\"\ndescription: \"Clear description of what this skill does and when to use it\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Your Name\"\ntags: [\"category1\", \"category2\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"keyword1\"\n  - \"phrase that triggers this\"\n---\n\n# Skill Title\n\nYour skill instructions go here...\n```\n\n## Required Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `name` | Unique identifier (lowercase, hyphens) | `\"code-review\"` |\n| `description` | When/why to use this skill | `\"Review code for quality and security issues\"` |\n\n## Optional Fields\n\n| Field | Description | Example |\n|-------|-------------|---------|\n| `version` | Semantic version | `\"1.0.0\"` |\n| `author` | Creator name | `\"Jane Developer\"` |\n| `tags` | Categorization keywords | `[\"review\", \"quality\"]` |\n| `trigger_patterns` | Words/phrases that activate skill | `[\"review\", \"check code\"]` |\n| `allowed_tools` | Tools this skill can use | `[\"code_execution\", \"web_search\"]` |\n\n## Skill Directory Structure\n\n```\n/a0/usr/skills/\n└── my-skill/\n   ├── SKILL.md           # Required: Main skill file\n   ├── scripts/           # Optional: Helper scripts\n   │   ├── helper.py\n   │   └── process.sh\n   ├── templates/         # Optional: Templates\n   │   └── output.md\n   └── docs/              # Optional: Additional docs\n      └── examples.md\n```\n\n## Writing Good Skill Instructions\n\n### Be Specific and Actionable\n\n```markdown\n# Good\nWhen reviewing code:\n1. Check for security vulnerabilities\n2. Verify error handling\n3. Assess test coverage\n\n# Bad\nReview the code and make it better.\n```\n\n### Include Examples\n\n```markdown\n## Example Usage\n\n**User**: \"Review my Python function for issues\"\n\n**Agent Response**:\n> I''ll review your function using the code review checklist:\n>\n> 1. **Security**: No user input validation detected\n> 2. **Error Handling**: Missing try-catch for file operations\n> 3. **Testing**: Function is testable but no tests found\n```\n\n### Provide Checklists\n\n```markdown\n## Review Checklist\n- [ ] Input validation present\n- [ ] Error handling complete\n- [ ] Tests included\n- [ ] Documentation updated\n```\n\n## Creating Your Skill: Step by Step\n\n### Step 1: Define Purpose\n\nAnswer these questions:\n- What problem does this skill solve?\n- When should the agent use it?\n- What''s the expected output?\n\n### Step 2: Choose a Name\n\n- Use lowercase letters and hyphens\n- Be descriptive but concise\n- Examples: `code-review`, `data-analysis`, `deploy-helper`\n\n### Step 3: Write Trigger Patterns\n\nList words/phrases that should activate this skill:\n\n```yaml\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"review\"\n  - \"check code\"\n  - \"code quality\"\n  - \"pull request\"\n```\n\n### Step 4: Structure Your Content\n\nOrganize with clear sections:\n\n```markdown\n# Skill Title\n\n## When to Use\nDescribe the trigger conditions\n\n## The Process\nStep-by-step instructions\n\n## Examples\nShow sample interactions\n\n## Tips\nAdditional guidance\n```\n\n### Step 5: Add Supporting Files (Optional)\n\nIf your skill needs scripts or templates:\n\n```bash\n# Create directory structure\nmkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/{scripts,templates,docs}\n```\n\n## Example: Complete Skill\n\n```yaml\n---\nname: \"python-optimizer\"\ndescription: \"Optimize Python code for performance and readability. Use when asked to improve or optimize Python code.\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nauthor: \"Agent Zero Team\"\ntags: [\"python\", \"optimization\", \"performance\"]\ntrigger_patterns:\n  - \"optimize python\"\n  - \"improve performance\"\n  - \"make faster\"\n  - \"python optimization\"\n---\n\n# Python Optimizer\n\n## When to Use\nActivate when user asks to optimize, improve, or speed up Python code.\n\n## Optimization Process\n\n### Step 1: Profile First\nBefore optimizing, understand where time is spent:\n```python\nimport cProfile\ncProfile.run(''your_function()'')\n```\n\n### Step 2: Common Optimizations\n\n1. **Use List Comprehensions**\n   ```python\n   # Slow\n   result = []\n   for x in data:\n       result.append(x * 2)\n\n   # Fast\n   result = [x * 2 for x in data]\n   ```\n\n2. **Use Sets for Lookups**\n   ```python\n   # Slow: O(n)\n   if item in large_list:\n\n   # Fast: O(1)\n   if item in large_set:\n   ```\n\n3. **Use Generators for Large Data**\n   ```python\n   # Memory-heavy\n   data = [process(x) for x in huge_list]\n\n   # Memory-efficient\n   data = (process(x) for x in huge_list)\n   ```\n\n### Step 3: Verify Improvement\nAlways measure before and after:\n```python\nimport time\nstart = time.perf_counter()\n# code to measure\nelapsed = time.perf_counter() - start\nprint(f\"Took {elapsed:.4f} seconds\")\n```\n\n## Anti-Patterns to Avoid\n- Premature optimization\n- Optimizing without profiling\n- Sacrificing readability for tiny gains\n```\n\n## Skill Installation\n\n### Local Installation\n\n1. Create skill directory:\n   ```bash\n   mkdir -p /a0/usr/skills/my-skill\n   ```\n\n2. Create SKILL.md:\n   ```bash\n   touch /a0/usr/skills/my-skill/SKILL.md\n   ```\n\n3. Add content and save\n\n4. Skills are automatically loaded on next agent initialization\n\n### Sharing Skills\n\nTo share skills with others:\n\n1. Create a GitHub repository\n2. Include the skill directory structure\n3. Add a README with installation instructions\n4. Users can copy to their `/a0/usr/skills/` directory\n\n## Testing Your Skill\n\nAfter creating a skill:\n\n1. Start a new conversation\n2. Use one of your trigger patterns\n3. Verify the agent follows your instructions\n4. Iterate and improve based on results"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:00:29.891Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agent Developers needing streamlined skill creation with SKILL.md standard compliance.","zh":"适合需要简化技能创建并遵循SKILL.md标准的AI Agent开发人员。","ja":"SKILL.md規格に準拠したスキル作成を簡素化する必要があるAIエージェント開発者に適しています。","ko":"SKILL.md 표준 규격을 준수하면서 스킬 생성을 간소화해야 하는 AI 에이전트 개발자에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para desarrolladores de Agentes de IA que necesitan una creación de habilidades simplificada con cumplimiento del estándar SKILL.md.","fr":"Parfait pour les développeurs d''agents IA ayant besoin d''une création de compétences simplifiée avec une conformité au standard SKILL.md.","de":"Perfekt für AI-Agent-Entwickler, die eine vereinfachte Fertigkeitserstellung mit SKILL.md-Standard-Konformität benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para desenvolvedores de Agentes de IA que necessitam de criação de habilidades otimizada com conformidade ao padrão SKILL.md.","ru":"Идеально для разработчиков агентов ИИ, которым необходима оптимизированная создание навыков в соответствии со стандартом SKILL.md.","ar":"مثالي لمطوري وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذين يحتاجون إلى إنشاء مهارة بمواصفات SKILL.md"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate new skills with structured trigger patterns, content structure, and supporting files using YAML frontmatter, enabling efficient skill development and integration with protocols like SKILL.md.","zh":"赋予代理生成新技能的能力，使用YAML前置内容创建结构化的触发模式、内容结构和支持文件，实现高效的技能开发和与SKILL.md等协议的集成。","ja":"YAMLフロントマターを使用して構造化されたトリガーパターン、コンテンツ構造、サポートファイルを作成し、SKILL.mdなどのプロトコルとの統合を可能にし、効率的なスキル開発を実現します。","ko":"YAML 프론트매퍼를 사용하여 구조화된 트리거 패턴, 콘텐츠 구조 및 지원 파일을 생성하여 효율적인 스킬 개발 및 SKILL.md와 같은 프로토콜과의 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar nuevas habilidades con patrones de activación estructurados, estructura de contenido y archivos de soporte que utilizan YAML frontmatter, lo que permite un desarrollo de habilidades eficiente y una integración con protocolos como SKILL.md.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer de nouvelles compétences avec des modèles de déclenchement structurés, une structure de contenu et des fichiers de support utilisant YAML frontmatter, ce qui permet un développement de compétences efficace et une intégration avec des protocoles comme SKILL.md.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, neue Fähigkeiten mit strukturierten Triggermustern, Inhaltsstruktur und Unterstützungsdateien zu generieren, die YAML-Frontmatter verwenden, was eine effiziente Fähigkeitsentwicklung und Integration mit Protokollen wie SKILL.md ermöglicht.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerar novas habilidades com padrões de gatilho estruturados, estrutura de conteúdo e arquivos de suporte usando frontmatter YAML, permitindo o desenvolvimento eficiente de habilidades e integração com protocolos como SKILL.md.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать новые навыки со структурированными шаблонами триггеров, структурой контента и вспомогательными файлами с использованием YAML-frontend, что обеспечивает эффективное развитие навыков и интеграцию с протоколами типа SKILL.md.","ar":"يمكن للوكيل إنشاء مهارات جديدة ذات أنماط.trigger بنية ، وهيكل محتوى ، وملفات داعمة باستخدام YAML-frontend ، مما يتيح تطوير مهارات فعال ودمجها مع بروتوكولات مثل SKILL.md"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating custom skills for Agent Zero","Defining trigger patterns for automated workflows","Structuring content for agent-based applications"],"zh":["为Agent Zero创建自定义技能","定义自动工作流程的触发模式","为基于代理的应用程序结构化内容"],"ja":["Agent Zero用のカスタムスキルを作成する","自動化されたワークフローのトリガーパターンを定義する","エージェントベースのアプリケーション用のコンテンツを構造化する"],"ko":["에이전트 제로를 위한 사용자 정의 스킬 생성","자동화된 워크플로우를 위한 트리거 패턴 정의","에이전트 기반 애플리케이션을 위한 콘텐츠 구조화"],"es":["Creación de habilidades personalizadas para Agent Zero","Definición de patrones de activación para flujos de trabajo automatizados","Estructuración de contenido para aplicaciones basadas en agentes"],"fr":["Création de compétences personnalisées pour Agent Zero","Définition de modèles de déclenchement pour flux de travail automatisés","Structuration de contenu pour applications basées sur des agents"],"de":["Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Fähigkeiten für Agent Zero","Definition von Triggermustern für automatisierte Workflows","Strukturierung von Inhalten für agentenbasierte Anwendungen"],"pt":["Criação de habilidades personalizadas para Agent Zero","Definição de padrões de gatilho para fluxos de trabalho automatizados","Estruturação de conteúdo para aplicações baseadas em agentes"],"ru":["Создание пользовательских навыков для Agent Zero","Определение шаблонов триггеров для автоматизированных рабочих процессов","Структуризация контента для приложений на основе агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء مهارات مخصصة لوكيل صفر","تحديد أنماط.trigger للتدفقات العملية الآلية","هيكلة المحتوى لتطبيقات الوكيل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires SKILL.md format compliance","Agent Zero compatibility necessary"],"zh":["需要遵循SKILL.md格式","需要Agent Zero的兼容性"],"ja":["SKILL.md形式への準拠が必要","Agent Zeroとの互換性が必要"],"ko":["SKILL.md 형식 준수가 필요","에이전트 제로와의 호환성이 필요"],"es":["Requiere cumplimiento del formato SKILL.md","Compatibilidad con Agent Zero necesaria"],"fr":["Nécessite une conformité au format SKILL.md","Compatibilité avec Agent Zero nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt SKILL.md-Format-Konformität","Kompatibilität mit Agent Zero erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige conformidade com o formato SKILL.md","Compatibilidade com Agent Zero necessária"],"ru":["Требует соответствия формату SKILL.md","Необходима совместимость с Agent Zero"],"ar":["يتطلب التآلف مع تنسيق SKILL.md","التوافق مع وكيل صفر ضروري"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"55f81fc1d57546548d400d6e71470643bc64fc7bbe464ebf40609712bb43bc0c","qualityScore":70}');
