вывода Azure CLI или описаний на естественн...","ar":"تعرف على كيفية استخدام.azure-diagrams لإنشاء رسومات بنية تحتية Azure من قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو описания لغة طبيعية للوكلاء الذكيين"},"definition":{"en":"azure-diagrams is a skill that generates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from various input sources, including ARM templates, Azure CLI output, and natural language descriptions.","zh":"Azure Diagram Generator 是一种 AI 工具，用于生成 Azure 基础设施图","ja":"Azure Diagram Generator は、Azure インフラストラクチャ図を生成する AI エージェントです","ko":"Azure Diagram Generator는 Azure 인프라스트럭처 다이어그램을 생성하는 AI 도구입니다","es":"Azure-diagrams es una herramienta de visualización de infraestructura de Azure que genera diagramas a partir de plantillas ARM y salida de Azure CLI","fr":"Azure-diagrams est un outil de visualisation d''infrastructure Azure qui génère des diagrammes à partir de modèles ARM et de sortie Azure CLI","de":"Azure-diagrams ist ein Tool zur Visualisierung von Azure-Infrastrukturen, das Diagramme aus ARM-Vorlagen und Azure-CLI-Ausgaben erstellt","pt":"O que é Azure Diagrams? É um gerador de diagramas de arquitetura de infraestrutura do Azure","ru":"Что такое Azure Diagrams? Это генератор диаграмм архитектуры инфраструктуры Azure","ar":"ما هو.azure-diagrams? هو مولد رسومات بنية تحتية Azure"},"features":{"en":["Generates architecture diagrams from ARM templates (JSON)","Supports Azure CLI output, such as `az vm list`","Visualizes Azure resources, including Virtual Machines and Storage Accounts","Accepts natural language descriptions as input","Helps users to diagram their Azure infrastructure"],"zh":["支持 ARM 模板（JSON）作为输入","支持 Azure CLI 输出作为输入","可以从自然语言描述生成图","支持多种 Azure 服务，包括虚拟机、存储账户和 VNet","可以根据用户的 Azure 基础设施生成自定义图"],"ja":["ARM テンプレート（JSON）を入力としてサポート","Azure CLI 出力を入力としてサポート","自然言語の説明から図を生成可能","仮想マシン、ストレージ アカウント、VNet などの複数の Azure サービスをサポート","ユーザーの Azure インフラストラクチャに基づいてカスタム図を生成可能"],"ko":["ARM 템플릿（JSON）을 입력으로 지원","Azure CLI 출력을 입력으로 지원","자연어 설명에서 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있습니다","가상 머신, 스토리지 계정, VNet 등의 여러 Azure 서비스를 지원","사용자의 Azure 인프라스트럭처에 따라 맞춤형 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있습니다"],"es":["Generación de diagramas de arquitectura de Azure desde plantillas ARM","Soporte para salida de Azure CLI","Visualización de recursos de Azure a partir de descripciones en lenguaje natural","Compatibilidad con servicios de Azure como Máquinas Virtuales, Cuentas de Almacenamiento y VNets","Generación de diagramas personalizados para infraestructuras de Azure"],"fr":["Génération de diagrammes d''architecture Azure à partir de modèles ARM","Prise en charge de la sortie Azure CLI","Visualisation de ressources Azure à partir de descriptions en langage naturel","Compatibilité avec les services Azure tels que Machines Virtuelles, Comptes de Stockage et VNets","Génération de diagrammes personnalisés pour les infrastructures Azure"],"de":["Erstellung von Azure-Architekturdiagrammen aus ARM-Vorlagen","Unterstützung für Azure-CLI-Ausgaben","Visualisierung von Azure-Ressourcen aus natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen","Kompatibilität mit Azure-Diensten wie virtuellen Maschinen, Speicherkonten und VNets","Erstellung von benutzerdefinierten Diagrammen für Azure-Infrastrukturen"],"pt":["Geração de diagramas a partir de modelos ARM","Suporte à saída do Azure CLI","Geração de diagramas a partir de descrições em linguagem natural","Visualização de recursos do Azure","Suporte a serviços do Azure, como Máquinas Virtuais e Contas de Armazenamento"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм из шаблонов ARM","Поддержка вывода Azure CLI","Генерация диаграмм из описаний на естественном языке","Визуализация ресурсов Azure","Поддержка сервисов Azure, таких как Виртуальные Машины и Учетные Записи Хранилища"],"ar":["إنشاء رسومات من قوالب ARM","دعم إخراج Azure CLI","إنشاء رسومات من описания لغة طبيعية","تجسيد موارد Azure","دعم خدمات Azure، مثل الافتراضية وأحواض التخزين"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use azure-diagrams","azure-diagrams setup guide","azure-diagrams alternative","azure-diagrams vs lucidchart","azure infrastructure visualization","arm template diagram generation","azure cli output visualization","azure resource manager template"],"zh":["Azure Diagram Generator","ARM 模板","Azure CLI","自然语言描述","Azure 基础设施图","AI 工具","Azure 服务","虚拟机","存储账户","VNet"],"ja":["Azure Diagram Generator","ARM テンプレート","Azure CLI","自然言語の説明","Azure インフラストラクチャ図","AI エージェント","Azure サービス","仮想マシン","ストレージ アカウント","VNet"],"ko":["Azure Diagram Generator","ARM 템플릿","Azure CLI","자연어 설명","Azure 인프라스트럭처 다이어그램","AI 도구","Azure 서비스","가상 머신","스토리지 계정","VNet"],"es":["azure-diagrams","herramientas de visualización de Azure","plantillas ARM","Azure CLI","descripciones en lenguaje natural","recursos de Azure","Máquinas Virtuales","Cuentas de Almacenamiento","VNets","infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["azure-diagrams","outils de visualisation Azure","modèles ARM","Azure CLI","descriptions en langage naturel","ressources Azure","Machines Virtuelles","Comptes de Stockage","VNets","infrastructure Azure"],"de":["azure-diagrams","Azure-Visualisierungstools","ARM-Vorlagen","Azure-CLI","natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen","Azure-Ressourcen","virtuelle Maschinen","Speicherkonten","VNets","Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["azure diagrams","gerador de diagramas","arm templates","azure cli","linguagem natural","recursos do azure","serviços do azure","máquinas virtuais","contas de armazenamento"],"ru":["azure diagrams","генератор диаграмм","шаблоны arm","azure cli","естественный язык","ресурсы azure","сервисы azure","виртуальные машины","учетные записи хранилища","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["azure-diagrams","مولد رسومات","قوالب arm","azure cli","لغة طبيعية","موارد azure","خدمات azure","الافتراضية","أحواض التخزين","الوكلاء الذكيين"]}},"owner":"gamingopgamingop","repo":"sarthak-skill-forge","repoPath":"gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.332Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"azure-diagrams","description":"Visualizes Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI, or descriptions. Use when user has Azure resources to diagram.","version":"1.0.0","tags":"azure, diagram, arm, resource-group, vnet, vm, storage, infrastructure","bodyPreview":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works","body":"# Azure Diagram Generator\n\nGenerates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions.\n\n## When to Use\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- User has ARM (Azure Resource Manager) templates (JSON)\n- User provides Azure CLI output (e.g., `az vm list`)\n- User wants to visualize Azure resources\n- User mentions Azure services (Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets, etc.)\n- User asks to \"diagram my Azure infrastructure\"\n\n## How It Works\n\nThis skill generates Azure-specific diagrams by parsing Azure resources and calling the Eraser API directly:\n\n1. **Parse Azure Resources**: Extract resources from ARM templates, CLI output, or descriptions\n2. **Map Azure Relationships**: Identify Resource Groups, VNets, subnets, and service connections\n3. **Generate Eraser DSL**: Create Eraser DSL code from Azure resources\n4. **Call Eraser API**: Use `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Instructions\n\nWhen the user provides Azure infrastructure information:\n\n1. **Parse the Source**\n\n   - **ARM Templates**: Extract `resources` array, identify types (Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines, etc.)\n   - **CLI Output**: Parse JSON output from `az` commands\n   - **Description**: Identify Azure service names and relationships\n\n2. **Identify Azure Components**\n\n   - **Networking**: Virtual Networks (VNets), Subnets, Network Security Groups, Load Balancers\n   - **Compute**: Virtual Machines, Virtual Machine Scale Sets, App Services, Functions\n   - **Storage**: Storage Accounts, Blob Storage, File Shares\n   - **Databases**: SQL Databases, Cosmos DB, Redis Cache\n   - **Security**: Network Security Groups, Azure AD, Key Vault\n   - **Load Balancing**: Application Gateway, Load Balancer, Traffic Manager\n   - **Other**: Service Bus, Event Hubs, API Management\n\n3. **Map Relationships**\n\n   - VMs in subnets\n   - Subnets in VNets\n   - VNets in Resource Groups\n   - Storage accounts accessed by VMs\n   - Databases accessed by applications\n   - Network Security Groups attached to subnets\n\n4. **Generate Eraser DSL** Convert Azure resources to Eraser DSL:\n\n   - **CRITICAL: Label Formatting Rules**\n     - Labels MUST be on a single line - NEVER use newlines inside label attributes\n     - Keep labels simple and readable - prefer separate labels over concatenating too much metadata\n     - Format DSL with proper line breaks (one node/group per line, but labels stay on single lines)\n     - If including metadata like CIDR blocks or instance types, include them in the same quoted label string: `[label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"]`\n\n   Example:\n\n   ```\n   myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n     subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1\"] {\n       myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"Virtual Machine\"]\n       gateway [icon: azure-app-gateway]\n     }\n     subnet2 [label: \"Subnet 2\"] {\n       database [icon: azure-sql]\n     }\n   }\n   storage [icon: azure-storage]\n   myVNet -> myVM\n   myVM -> database\n   ```\n\n5. **Make the HTTP Request**\n\n   **IMPORTANT**: You MUST execute this curl command after generating the DSL. Never stop after generating DSL without making the API call.\n\n   **CRITICAL**: In the `X-Skill-Source` header below, you MUST replace the value with your AI agent name:\n   - If you are Claude (Anthropic), use: `claude`\n   - If you are running in Cursor, use: `cursor`\n   - If you are ChatGPT (OpenAI), use: `chatgpt`\n   - If you are Gemini (Google), use: `gemini`\n   - Otherwise, use your model/agent name in lowercase\n\n   ```bash\n   curl -X POST https://app.eraser.io/api/render/elements \\\n     -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -H \"X-Skill-Source: eraser-skill\" \\\n     -H \"Authorization: Bearer ${ERASER_API_KEY}\" \\\n     -d ''{\n       \"elements\": [{\n         \"type\": \"diagram\",\n         \"id\": \"diagram-1\",\n         \"code\": \"<your generated DSL>\",\n         \"diagramType\": \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"\n       }],\n       \"scale\": 2,\n       \"theme\": \"${ERASER_THEME:-dark}\",\n       \"background\": true\n     }''\n   ```\n\n6. **Track Sources During Analysis**\n\n   As you analyze files and resources to generate the diagram, track:\n\n   - **Internal files**: Record each file path you read and what information was extracted (e.g., `infra/main.bicep` - VNet and subnet definitions)\n   - **External references**: Note any documentation, examples, or URLs consulted (e.g., Azure architecture best practices documentation)\n   - **Annotations**: For each source, note what it contributed to the diagram\n\n7. **Handle the Response**\n\n   **CRITICAL: Minimal Output Format**\n\n   Your response MUST always include these elements with clear headers:\n\n   1. **Diagram Preview**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Diagram\n      ![{Title}]({imageUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL `imageUrl` from the API response.\n\n   2. **Editor Link**: Display with a header\n      ```\n      ## Open in Eraser\n      [Edit this diagram in the Eraser editor]({createEraserFileUrl})\n      ```\n      Use the ACTUAL URL from the API response.\n\n   3. **Sources section**: Brief list of files/resources analyzed (if applicable)\n      ```\n      ## Sources\n      - `path/to/file` - What was extracted\n      ```\n\n   4. **Diagram Code section**: The Eraser DSL in a code block with `eraser` language tag\n      ```\n      ## Diagram Code\n      ```eraser\n      {DSL code here}\n      ```\n      ```\n\n   5. **Learn More link**: `You can learn more about Eraser at https://docs.eraser.io/docs/using-ai-agent-integrations`\n\n   **Additional content rules:**\n   - If the user ONLY asked for a diagram, include NOTHING beyond the 5 elements above\n   - If the user explicitly asked for more (e.g., \"explain the architecture\", \"suggest improvements\"), you may include that additional content\n   - Never add unrequested sections like Overview, Security Considerations, Testing, etc.\n\n   The default output should be SHORT. The diagram image speaks for itself.\n\n## Azure-Specific Tips\n\n- **Resource Groups**: Show Resource Groups as logical containers\n- **VNets as Containers**: Always show VNets containing subnets and resources\n- **Network Security Groups**: Include NSG rules and attachments\n- **Subscriptions**: Note subscription context if provided\n- **Data Flow**: Show traffic flow (Internet → Application Gateway → VM → SQL Database)\n- **Use Azure Icons**: Request Azure-specific styling in the description\n\n## Example: ARM Template with Multiple Azure Services\n\n### User Input\n\n```json\n{\n  \"resources\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Resources/resourceGroups\",\n      \"name\": \"rg-main\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Network/virtualNetworks\",\n      \"name\": \"myVNet\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"addressSpace\": {\n          \"addressPrefixes\": [\"10.0.0.0/16\"]\n        },\n        \"subnets\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"subnet1\",\n            \"properties\": {\n              \"addressPrefix\": \"10.0.1.0/24\"\n            }\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Compute/virtualMachines\",\n      \"name\": \"myVM\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"hardwareProfile\": {\n          \"vmSize\": \"Standard_B1s\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Web/sites\",\n      \"name\": \"myAppService\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"serverFarmId\": \"/subscriptions/.../serverfarms/myPlan\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts\",\n      \"name\": \"mystorageaccount\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"Microsoft.Sql/servers\",\n      \"name\": \"mysqlserver\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"administratorLogin\": \"admin\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses ARM template:\n\n   - **Resource Group**: rg-main (container)\n   - **Networking**: VNet with subnet\n   - **Compute**: VM, App Service\n   - **Storage**: Storage Account\n   - **Database**: SQL Server\n\n2. Generates DSL showing Azure service diversity:\n\n   ```\n   resource-group [label: \"Resource Group rg-main\"] {\n     myVNet [label: \"VNet 10.0.0.0/16\"] {\n       subnet1 [label: \"Subnet 1 10.0.1.0/24\"] {\n         myVM [icon: azure-vm, label: \"VM Standard_B1s\"]\n       }\n     }\n     myAppService [icon: azure-app-service, label: \"App Service\"]\n     mystorageaccount [icon: azure-storage, label: \"Storage Account\"]\n     mysqlserver [icon: azure-sql, label: \"SQL Server\"]\n   }\n\n   myAppService -> mystorageaccount\n   myVM -> mysqlserver\n   ```\n\n   **Important**: All label text must be on a single line within quotes. Azure-specific: Show Resource Groups as containers, include App Services, Storage Accounts, and SQL databases with proper Azure icons.\n\n3. Calls `/api/render/elements` with `diagramType: \"cloud-architecture-diagram\"`\n\n## Example: Azure CLI Output\n\n### User Input\n\n```\nUser runs: az vm list --output json\nProvides JSON output\n```\n\n### Expected Behavior\n\n1. Parses JSON to extract:\n\n   - VM names, sizes, states\n   - Resource groups\n   - Network interfaces\n   - Storage accounts\n\n2. Formats and calls API\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:13.933Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Cloud Analysis Agents needing advanced Azure infrastructure visualization capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Azure 基础设施可视化能力的 Cloud Analysis Agents。","ja":"Azure インフラストラクチャの高度な可視化機能を必要とする Cloud Analysis エージェントに最適です。","ko":"고급 Azure 인프라 시각화 기능이 필요한 Cloud Analysis 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de análisis en la nube que necesitan capacidades de visualización de infraestructura de Azure avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse cloud nécessitant des capacités de visualisation d''infrastructure Azure avancées.","de":"Perfekt für Cloud-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Azure-Infrastruktur-Visualisierungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise de Nuvem que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de infraestrutura do Azure.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа облака, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности визуализации инфраструктуры Azure.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل السحابة الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لتصور بنية Azure."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate comprehensive architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions, utilizing JSON and Azure services like Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, and VNets.","zh":"使得代理能够生成 Azure 基础设施的综合体系结构图，从 ARM 模板、Azure CLI 输出或自然语言描述生成，利用 JSON 和 Azure 服务，如虚拟机、存储帐户和 VNets。","ja":"エージェントが ARM テンプレート、Azure CLI の出力、または自然言語の説明から Azure インフラストラクチャの包括的なアーキテクチャ ダイアグラムを生成できるようにします。JSON と Azure サービス (仮想マシン、ストレージ アカウント、VNets など) を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 ARM 템플릿, Azure CLI 출력 또는 자연어 설명에서 Azure 인프라의 포괄적인 아키텍처 다이어그램을 생성할 수 있도록 합니다. JSON 및 Azure 서비스(Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, VNets 등)를 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes generar diagramas de arquitectura completos para la infraestructura de Azure a partir de plantillas de ARM, salida de Azure CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural, utilizando JSON y servicios de Azure como Máquinas Virtuales, Cuentas de Almacenamiento y VNets.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des diagrammes d''architecture complets pour l''infrastructure Azure à partir de modèles ARM, de sortie Azure CLI ou de descriptions en langage naturel, en utilisant JSON et des services Azure tels que des Machines Virtuelles, des Comptes de Stockage et des VNets.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, umfassende Architekturdiagramme für die Azure-Infrastruktur aus ARM-Vorlagen, Azure-CLI-Ausgabe oder natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen zu erstellen, indem JSON und Azure-Dienste wie virtuelle Computer, Speicherkonten und VNets verwendet werden.","pt":"Permite que os agentes gerem diagramas de arquitetura abrangentes para infraestrutura do Azure a partir de modelos ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural, utilizando JSON e serviços do Azure como Máquinas Virtuais, Contas de Armazenamento e VNets.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать полные архитектурные диаграммы для инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или естественно-языковых описаний, используя JSON и сервисы Azure, такие как Виртуальные Машины, Учетные записи хранения и VNets.","ar":"يمكن للعميل توليد رسوم بيانية شاملة لهياكل بنية Azure من قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو وصفات لغة طبيعية ، باستخدام JSON وخدمات Azure مثل الماكينات الافتراضية و حسابات التخزين و VNets."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating diagrams from ARM templates for Azure resource visualization","Creating visual representations of Azure infrastructure from Azure CLI output","Automating the documentation of Azure resources using natural language descriptions"],"zh":["从 ARM 模板生成图表以可视化 Azure 资源","从 Azure CLI 输出创建 Azure 基础设施的可视化表示","使用自然语言描述自动记录 Azure 资源"],"ja":["ARM テンプレートから Azure リソースの可視化のために図を生成する","Azure CLI の出力を使用して Azure インフラストラクチャの視覚的な表現を作成する","自然言語の説明を使用して Azure リソースのドキュメントを自動化する"],"ko":["ARM 템플릿에서 Azure 리소스 시각화를 위해 다이어그램을 생성하는 것","Azure CLI 출력에서 Azure 인프라의 시각적 표현을 생성하는 것","자연어 설명을 사용하여 Azure 리소스 문서를 자동화하는 것"],"es":["Generar diagramas a partir de plantillas de ARM para la visualización de recursos de Azure","Crear representaciones visuales de la infraestructura de Azure a partir de la salida de Azure CLI","Automatizar la documentación de los recursos de Azure mediante descripciones en lenguaje natural"],"fr":["Générer des diagrammes à partir de modèles ARM pour la visualisation des ressources Azure","Créer des représentations visuelles de l''infrastructure Azure à partir de la sortie Azure CLI","Automatiser la documentation des ressources Azure à l''aide de descriptions en langage naturel"],"de":["Erstellen von Diagrammen aus ARM-Vorlagen für die Visualisierung von Azure-Ressourcen","Erstellen von visuellen Darstellungen der Azure-Infrastruktur aus der Azure-CLI-Ausgabe","Automatisieren der Dokumentation von Azure-Ressourcen mithilfe von natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen"],"pt":["Gerar diagramas a partir de modelos ARM para visualização de recursos do Azure","Criar representações visuais da infraestrutura do Azure a partir da saída do Azure CLI","Automatizar a documentação de recursos do Azure usando descrições em linguagem natural"],"ru":["Генерация диаграмм из шаблонов ARM для визуализации ресурсов Azure","Создание визуальных представлений инфраструктуры Azure из вывода Azure CLI","Автоматизация документации ресурсов Azure с использованием естественно-языковых описаний"],"ar":["توليد رسوم بيانية من قوالب ARM لتصور الموارد في Azure","إنشاء تمثيلات بصرية لهياكل بنية Azure من إخراج Azure CLI","توفير توثيق الموارد في Azure باستخدام وصفات لغة طبيعية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions as input","Limited to Azure infrastructure visualization"],"zh":["需要 ARM 模板、Azure CLI 输出或自然语言描述作为输入","仅限 Azure 基础设施可视化"],"ja":["ARM テンプレート、Azure CLI の出力、または自然言語の説明を入力として必要とする","Azure インフラストラクチャの可視化に限定される"],"ko":["ARM 템플릿, Azure CLI 출력 또는 자연어 설명을 입력으로 필요로 함","Azure 인프라 시각화에만 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere plantillas de ARM, salida de Azure CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural como entrada","Limitado a la visualización de la infraestructura de Azure"],"fr":["Nécessite des modèles ARM, une sortie Azure CLI ou des descriptions en langage naturel comme entrée","Limité à la visualisation de l''infrastructure Azure"],"de":["Benötigt ARM-Vorlagen, Azure-CLI-Ausgabe oder natürliche Sprachbeschreibungen als Eingabe","Begrenzt auf die Visualisierung der Azure-Infrastruktur"],"pt":["Exige modelos ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural como entrada","Limitado à visualização de infraestrutura do Azure"],"ru":["Требует шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или естественно-языковых описаний в качестве входных данных","Ограничен визуализацией инфраструктуры Azure"],"ar":["يتطلب قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو وصفات لغة طبيعية كمدخلات","محدود بتصور بنية Azure"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"7a2a9640b208428d82d03e5ab5929f26919f68b11996b73fd9c9b5a3b39058b8","qualityScore":70}');
