INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('gamingopgamingop/sarthak-skill-forge/azure-diagrams', 'azure-diagrams', 'gamingopgamingop', 'sarthak-skill-forge', 'community', 'azure-diagrams gamingopgamingop sarthak-skill-forge community The azure-diagrams skill generates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from ARM templates, Azure CLI output, or natural language descriptions, benefiting developers and architects. It visualizes Azure resources, including Virtual Machines, Storage Accounts, and VNets. Azure Diagram Generator 是一种从 ARM 模板、Azure CLI 输出或自然语言描述生成 Azure 基础设施图的工具。它支持多种输入格式，包括 JSON 和 Azure CLI 输出 Azure Diagram Generator は、ARM テンプレート、Azure CLI 出力、または自然言語の説明から Azure インフラストラクチャ図を生成するツールです。多くの入力形式をサポートしています Azure Diagram Generator는 ARM 템플릿, Azure CLI 출력 또는 자연어 설명에서 Azure 인프라스트럭처 다이어그램을 생성하는 도구입니다. JSON 및 Azure CLI 출력과 같은 여러 입력 형식을 지원합니다 Azure-diagrams es una herramienta que genera diagramas de arquitectura de Azure desde plantillas ARM, salida de Azure CLI o descripciones en lenguaje natural Azure-diagrams est un outil qui génère des diagrammes d''architecture Azure à partir de modèles ARM, de sortie Azure CLI ou de descriptions en langage naturel Azure-diagrams ist ein Tool, das Azure-Architekturdiagramme aus ARM-Vorlagen, Azure-CLI-Ausgaben oder natürlichen Sprachbeschreibungen erstellt O Azure Diagrams gera diagramas de arquitetura de infraestrutura do Azure a partir de modelos ARM, saída do Azure CLI ou descrições em linguagem natural Azure Diagrams генерирует диаграммы архитектуры инфраструктуры Azure из шаблонов ARM, вывода Azure CLI или описаний на естественном языке يولد.azure-diagrams رسومات بنية تحتية Azure من قوالب ARM أو إخراج Azure CLI أو описания لغة طبيعية how to use azure-diagrams azure-diagrams setup guide azure-diagrams alternative azure-diagrams vs lucidchart azure infrastructure visualization arm template diagram generation azure cli output visualization azure resource manager template Azure Diagram Generator ARM 模板 Azure CLI 自然语言描述 Azure 基础设施图 AI 工具 Azure 服务 虚拟机 存储账户 VNet Generates architecture diagrams from ARM templates (JSON) Supports Azure CLI output, such as `az vm list` Visualizes Azure resources, including Virtual Machines and Storage Accounts Accepts natural language descriptions as input Helps users to diagram their Azure infrastructure azure-diagrams is a skill that generates architecture diagrams for Azure infrastructure from various input sources, including ARM templates, Azure CLI output, and natural language descriptions.');
