alues, and errors","Supports complex form patterns like arrays and nested objects","Enables async form submissions","Allows building custom form components with Formik hooks","Optimizes form performance"],"zh":["支持React表单构建","提供强大的验证功能（支持Yup）","管理表单状态、字段值和错误","支持复杂表单模式（数组、嵌套对象、动态字段）","支持异步表单提交"],"ja":["Reactフォームの構築をサポート","強力なバリデーション機能を提供（Yup対応）","フォームのステート、フィールド値、エラーを管理","複雑なフォームパターン（配列、ネストされたオブジェクト、動的フィールド）をサポート","非同期フォーム送信をサポート"],"ko":["리액트 폼 구축을 지원","강력한 유효성 검사 기능을 제공（Yup 지원）","폼 상태, 필드 값, 에러를 관리","복잡한 폼 패턴（배열, 중첩된 객체, 동적 필드）을 지원","비동기 폼 제출을 지원"],"es":["Creación de formularios en React con validación","Gestión de estado y valores de campo","Implementación de patrones de formulario complejos","Envío de formularios asíncronos","Creación de componentes de formulario personalizados con hooks de Formik","Optimización del rendimiento de los formularios"],"fr":["Création de formulaires React avec validation","Gestion d''état et de valeurs de champ","Mise en œuvre de modèles de formulaire complexes","Envoi de formulaires asynchrones","Création de composants de formulaire personnalisés avec des hooks Formik","Optimisation des performances des formulaires"],"de":["Erstellung von Formularen in React mit Validierung","Verwaltung von Zustand und Feldwerten","Implementierung komplexer Formularmuster","Asynchrone Formulareinreichung","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Formularkomponenten mit Formik-Hooks","Optimierung der Formularleistung"],"pt":["Criação de formulários em React","Validação de formulários com ou sem Yup","Gerenciamento de estado de formulários","Implementação de padrões de formulários complexos","Envio assíncrono de formulários","Criação de componentes de formulários personalizados com hooks do Formik"],"ru":["Создание форм в React","Валидация форм с или без Yup","Управление состоянием форм","Реализация сложных шаблонов форм","Асинхронная отправка форм","Создание пользовательских компонентов форм с помощью хуков Formik"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج في React","التحقق من صحة النماذج مع أو بدون Yup","التحكم في حالة النماذج","تنفيذ أنماط نماذج معقدة","إرسال النماذج بشكل غير متزامن","إنشاء مكونات نموذج مخصصة باستخدام hooks Formik"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use formik","formik vs react-hook-form","formik install","formik setup guide","what is formik","formik alternative","formik validation","formik react forms","formik tutorial"],"zh":["formik","react表单","表单验证","状态管理","异步提交","formik教程","react表单构建"],"ja":["Formik","Reactフォーム","フォームバリデーション","ステート管理","非同期送信","Formikチュートリアル","Reactフォーム構築"],"ko":["formik","리액트 폼","폼 유효성 검사","상태 관리","비동기 제출","formik 가이드","리액트 폼 구축"],"es":["formik react","creación de formularios en react","validación de formularios en react","gestión de estado en react","patrones de formulario complejos","envío de formularios asíncronos","optimización de rendimiento en react"],"fr":["formik react","création de formulaires dans react","validation de formulaires dans react","gestion d''état dans react","modèles de formulaire complexes","envoi de formulaires asynchrones","optimisation des performances dans react"],"de":["formik react","erstellung von formularen in react","validierung von formularen in react","zustandsverwaltung in react","komplexe formularmuster","asynchrone formulareinreichung","leistungsoptimierung in react"],"pt":["formik react","criar formulários em react","validação de formulários react","gerenciamento de estado de formulários react","formulários complexos react","formik tutorial","formik exemplos"],"ru":["formik react","создание форм в react","валидация форм react","управление состоянием форм react","сложные формы react","formik учебник","formik примеры"],"ar":["formik react","إنشاء نماذج في react","التحقق من صحة النماذج react","التحكم في حالة النماذج react","نماذج معقدة react","formik دروس","formik أمثلة"]}},"owner":"chathuraed","repo":"existing_project","repoPath":"chathuraed/existing_project","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.340Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"formik","description":"Build React forms with Formik library including validation, field management, form state, error handling, and async submissions. Use when creating forms, handling form validation with Yup, managing field state, or implementing complex form patterns in React applications.","version":"1.0","tags":["react","forms","formik","validation","yup","typescript"],"bodyPreview":"# Formik Skill\n\nA comprehensive guide for building forms in React using Formik, the most popular open-source form library.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create forms in React applications\n- Handle form validation (with or without Yup)\n- Manage form state, field values, and errors\n- Implement complex form patterns (arrays, nested objects, dynamic fields)\n- Handle async form submissions\n- Build custom form components with Formik hooks\n- Optimize form performance wi","body":"# Formik Skill\n\nA comprehensive guide for building forms in React using Formik, the most popular open-source form library.\n\n## When to use this skill\n\nUse this skill when you need to:\n- Create forms in React applications\n- Handle form validation (with or without Yup)\n- Manage form state, field values, and errors\n- Implement complex form patterns (arrays, nested objects, dynamic fields)\n- Handle async form submissions\n- Build custom form components with Formik hooks\n- Optimize form performance with FastField\n\n## Core Concepts\n\n### The Formik Component\n\nFormik manages form state and provides helper methods through render props or child functions:\n\n```jsx\nimport { Formik, Form, Field, ErrorMessage } from ''formik'';\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{ email: '''', password: '''' }}\n  validate={values => {\n    const errors = {};\n    if (!values.email) {\n      errors.email = ''Required'';\n    }\n    return errors;\n  }}\n  onSubmit={(values, { setSubmitting }) => {\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      alert(JSON.stringify(values, null, 2));\n      setSubmitting(false);\n    }, 400);\n  }}\n>\n  {({ isSubmitting }) => (\n    <Form>\n      <Field type=\"email\" name=\"email\" />\n      <ErrorMessage name=\"email\" component=\"div\" />\n      <Field type=\"password\" name=\"password\" />\n      <ErrorMessage name=\"password\" component=\"div\" />\n      <button type=\"submit\" disabled={isSubmitting}>\n        Submit\n      </button>\n    </Form>\n  )}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Using Formik Hooks (Recommended)\n\nThe modern approach uses hooks for cleaner code:\n\n```jsx\nimport { useFormik } from ''formik'';\n\nfunction MyForm() {\n  const formik = useFormik({\n    initialValues: {\n      firstName: '''',\n      lastName: '''',\n      email: '''',\n    },\n    onSubmit: values => {\n      alert(JSON.stringify(values, null, 2));\n    },\n  });\n  \n  return (\n    <form onSubmit={formik.handleSubmit}>\n      <input\n        id=\"firstName\"\n        name=\"firstName\"\n        type=\"text\"\n        onChange={formik.handleChange}\n        value={formik.values.firstName}\n      />\n      \n      <input\n        id=\"email\"\n        name=\"email\"\n        type=\"email\"\n        onChange={formik.handleChange}\n        value={formik.values.email}\n      />\n      \n      <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n    </form>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Validation\n\n### Schema Validation with Yup\n\nFormik integrates seamlessly with Yup for schema-based validation:\n\n```jsx\nimport * as Yup from ''yup'';\n\nconst SignupSchema = Yup.object().shape({\n  firstName: Yup.string()\n    .min(2, ''Too Short!'')\n    .max(50, ''Too Long!'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  lastName: Yup.string()\n    .min(2, ''Too Short!'')\n    .max(50, ''Too Long!'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  email: Yup.string()\n    .email(''Invalid email'')\n    .required(''Required''),\n  age: Yup.number()\n    .positive()\n    .integer()\n    .required(''Required''),\n});\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{\n    firstName: '''',\n    lastName: '''',\n    email: '''',\n    age: '''',\n  }}\n  validationSchema={SignupSchema}\n  onSubmit={values => {\n    console.log(values);\n  }}\n>\n  {/* ... */}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Custom Validation Function\n\nFor more control, write custom validation:\n\n```jsx\nconst validate = values => {\n  const errors = {};\n  \n  if (!values.email) {\n    errors.email = ''Required'';\n  } else if (!/^[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}$/i.test(values.email)) {\n    errors.email = ''Invalid email address'';\n  }\n  \n  if (!values.password) {\n    errors.password = ''Required'';\n  } else if (values.password.length < 8) {\n    errors.password = ''Password must be at least 8 characters'';\n  }\n  \n  return errors;\n};\n```\n\n### Field-Level Validation\n\nValidate individual fields:\n\n```jsx\nfunction validateEmail(value) {\n  let error;\n  if (!value) {\n    error = ''Required'';\n  } else if (!/^[A-Z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Z0-9.-]+\\.[A-Z]{2,}$/i.test(value)) {\n    error = ''Invalid email address'';\n  }\n  return error;\n}\n\n<Field name=\"email\" validate={validateEmail} />\n```\n\n## Field Components\n\n### Basic Field Usage\n\nThe `Field` component handles common input types:\n\n```jsx\n<Field name=\"email\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email\" />\n<Field name=\"description\" as=\"textarea\" rows=\"5\" />\n<Field name=\"color\" as=\"select\">\n  <option value=\"red\">Red</option>\n  <option value=\"green\">Green</option>\n  <option value=\"blue\">Blue</option>\n</Field>\n```\n\n### Radio Buttons\n\n```jsx\n<div role=\"group\">\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"radio\" name=\"contactMethod\" value=\"email\" />\n    Email\n  </label>\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"radio\" name=\"contactMethod\" value=\"phone\" />\n    Phone\n  </label>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Checkboxes\n\n```jsx\n<label>\n  <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"acceptTerms\" />\n  I accept the terms and conditions\n</label>\n\n{/* Checkbox group */}\n<div role=\"group\">\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"hobbies\" value=\"reading\" />\n    Reading\n  </label>\n  <label>\n    <Field type=\"checkbox\" name=\"hobbies\" value=\"coding\" />\n    Coding\n  </label>\n</div>\n```\n\n### Custom Field Components\n\n```jsx\nconst MyInput = ({ field, form, ...props }) => {\n  return <input {...field} {...props} />;\n};\n\n<Field name=\"email\" component={MyInput} />\n```\n\n## Displaying Errors\n\n### Using ErrorMessage Component\n\n```jsx\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\" />\n\n{/* Custom error component */}\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\" component=\"div\" className=\"error\" />\n\n{/* Render prop for custom styling */}\n<ErrorMessage name=\"email\">\n  {msg => <div className=\"error-message\">{msg}</div>}\n</ErrorMessage>\n```\n\n### Manual Error Display\n\n```jsx\n{formik.touched.email && formik.errors.email ? (\n  <div className=\"error\">{formik.errors.email}</div>\n) : null}\n```\n\n## Advanced Patterns\n\n### FieldArray for Dynamic Lists\n\nHandle arrays of fields:\n\n```jsx\nimport { FieldArray } from ''formik'';\n\n<Formik\n  initialValues={{ friends: [''''] }}\n  onSubmit={values => console.log(values)}\n>\n  {({ values }) => (\n    <Form>\n      <FieldArray name=\"friends\">\n        {({ insert, remove, push }) => (\n          <div>\n            {values.friends.length > 0 &&\n              values.friends.map((friend, index) => (\n                <div key={index}>\n                  <Field name={`friends.${index}`} />\n                  <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => remove(index)}>\n                    Remove\n                  </button>\n                </div>\n              ))}\n            <button type=\"button\" onClick={() => push('''')}>\n              Add Friend\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        )}\n      </FieldArray>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Submit</button>\n    </Form>\n  )}\n</Formik>\n```\n\n### Nested Objects\n\nHandle nested form data:\n\n```jsx\ninitialValues={{\n  user: {\n    name: '''',\n    address: {\n      street: '''',\n      city: '''',\n      zip: ''''\n    }\n  }\n}}\n\n<Field name=\"user.name\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.street\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.city\" />\n<Field name=\"user.address.zip\" />\n```\n\n### Dependent Fields\n\nUpdate fields based on other field values:\n\n```jsx\nconst formik = useFormik({\n  initialValues: {\n    country: '''',\n    state: ''''\n  },\n  onSubmit: values => console.log(values)\n});\n\nuseEffect(() => {\n  // Reset state when country changes\n  if (formik.values.country) {\n    formik.setFieldValue(''state'', '''');\n  }\n}, [formik.values.country]);\n```\n\n## Form Submission\n\n### Basic Submission\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={(values, { setSubmitting, setErrors, setStatus, resetForm }) => {\n  // values: form data\n  // setSubmitting: toggle submission state\n  // setErrors: set field errors\n  // setStatus: set form-level status\n  // resetForm: reset form to initial state\n  \n  setTimeout(() => {\n    console.log(values);\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }, 400);\n}\n```\n\n### Async Submission with API\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={async (values, { setSubmitting, setErrors }) => {\n  try {\n    const response = await fetch(''/api/submit'', {\n      method: ''POST'',\n      headers: { ''Content-Type'': ''application/json'' },\n      body: JSON.stringify(values)\n    });\n    \n    if (!response.ok) {\n      const errors = await response.json();\n      setErrors(errors);\n    } else {\n      // Handle success\n      alert(''Form submitted successfully!'');\n    }\n  } catch (error) {\n    setErrors({ submit: ''Network error occurred'' });\n  } finally {\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Server-Side Validation Errors\n\n```jsx\nonSubmit={async (values, { setFieldError, setSubmitting }) => {\n  try {\n    await api.submit(values);\n  } catch (error) {\n    if (error.response?.data?.errors) {\n      // Set individual field errors from server\n      Object.entries(error.response.data.errors).forEach(([field, message]) => {\n        setFieldError(field, message);\n      });\n    }\n  } finally {\n    setSubmitting(false);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Performance Optimization\n\n### FastField\n\nFor large forms, use FastField to prevent unnecessary re-renders:\n\n```jsx\nimport { FastField } from ''formik'';\n\n// Only re-renders when its own value, error, or touched status changes\n<FastField name=\"firstName\" />\n```\n\n### When to use FastField\n\n- Forms with 30+ fields\n- Fields that don''t depend on other field values\n- Fields without complex validation logic\n\n**Don''t use FastField when:**\n- Fields need to react to changes in other fields\n- You''re using field-level validation that depends on other values\n\n## Common Form Helpers\n\n### getFieldProps\n\nSimplify field bindings:\n\n```jsx\n<input\n  type=\"text\"\n  {...formik.getFieldProps(''firstName'')}\n  // Equivalent to:\n  // name=\"firstName\"\n  // value={formik.values.firstName}\n  // onChange={formik.handleChange}\n  // onBlur={formik.handleBlur}\n/>\n```\n\n### setFieldValue\n\nProgrammatically set field values:\n\n```jsx\nformik.setFieldValue(''email'', ''user@example.com'');\nformik.setFieldValue(''user.address.city'', ''New York'');\n```\n\n### resetForm\n\nReset form to initial or specific values:\n\n```jsx\n// Reset to initial values\nformik.resetForm();\n\n// Reset to new values\nformik.resetForm({\n  values: { email: '''', password: '''' }\n});\n```\n\n## Form-Level Helpers\n\n### Form State Properties\n\n```jsx\nformik.values        // Current form values\nformik.errors        // Validation errors\nformik.touched       // Which fields have been visited\nformik.isSubmitting  // Submission in progress\nformik.isValid       // Form passes validation\nformik.dirty         // Form has been modified\nformik.isValidating  // Validation in progress\n```\n\n### Form Methods\n\n```jsx\nformik.handleSubmit()    // Submit handler\nformik.handleReset()     // Reset handler\nformik.validateForm()    // Trigger validation\nformik.setFieldTouched() // Mark field as touched\nformik.setErrors()       // Set multiple errors\nformik.setValues()       // Set multiple values\n```\n\n## Integration Examples\n\n### With Material-UI\n\n```jsx\nimport TextField from ''@mui/material/TextField'';\n\n<Field name=\"email\">\n  {({ field, meta }) => (\n    <TextField\n      {...field}\n      label=\"Email\"\n      error={meta.touched && Boolean(meta.error)}\n      helperText={meta.touched && meta.error}\n    />\n  )}\n</Field>\n```\n\n### With React Router\n\nNavigate after successful submission:\n\n```jsx\nimport { useNavigate } from ''react-router-dom'';\n\nfunction MyForm() {\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n  \n  const formik = useFormik({\n    initialValues: { /* ... */ },\n    onSubmit: async (values) => {\n      await api.submit(values);\n      navigate(''/success'');\n    }\n  });\n  \n  return <form onSubmit={formik.handleSubmit}>...</form>;\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n1. **Always use validationSchema with Yup** for complex validation instead of custom validate functions\n2. **Use Field components** instead of manual input bindings for automatic state management\n3. **Handle isSubmitting** to disable submit buttons and prevent double submissions\n4. **Show errors only after touch** using `touched` to avoid showing errors prematurely\n5. **Use getFieldProps** for cleaner code when binding inputs\n6. **Consider FastField** for performance in large forms\n7. **Reset forms after success** using `resetForm()` when appropriate\n8. **Use setStatus** for form-level messages (success, error) that aren''t field-specific\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Not checking `touched` before showing errors** - shows all errors immediately\n2. **Forgetting to set `isSubmitting` to false** - leaves form in submitting state\n3. **Using FastField incorrectly** - breaks dependent field logic\n4. **Not handling async validation errors** - API errors get lost\n5. **Mutating form values directly** - always use `setFieldValue` or `setValues`\n6. **Missing name attribute** on Field components - breaks field binding\n\n## Debugging Tips\n\nCheck form state in DevTools:\n\n```jsx\n<pre>{JSON.stringify(formik, null, 2)}</pre>\n```\n\nEnable Formik debug mode:\n\n```jsx\n<Formik\n  enableReinitialize  // Reset when initialValues change\n  validateOnChange    // Validate on every keystroke (default: true)\n  validateOnBlur      // Validate on blur (default: true)\n  validateOnMount     // Validate on mount (default: false)\n>\n```\n\n## Additional Resources\n\n- See [references/EXAMPLES.md](references/EXAMPLES.md) for complete form examples\n- See [references/YUP_VALIDATION.md](references/YUP_VALIDATION.md) for comprehensive Yup validation patterns\n- See [assets/form-template.jsx](assets/form-template.jsx) for a starter template\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n**Installation:**\n```bash\nnpm install formik yup\n```\n\n**Basic Form:**\n```jsx\nimport { useFormik } from ''formik'';\n\nconst formik = useFormik({\n  initialValues: { email: '''' },\n  onSubmit: values => console.log(values)\n});\n```\n\n**With Validation:**\n```jsx\nimport * as Yup from ''yup'';\n\nvalidationSchema: Yup.object({\n  email: Yup.string().email().required()\n})\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:03:26.292Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents building complex React applications needing efficient form state management and validation.","zh":"非常适合构建复杂 React 应用程序的前端代理，需要高效的表单状态管理和验证。","ja":"複雑な React アプリケーションを構築するフロントエンドエージェントに最適で、効率的なフォーム状態管理とバリデーションを必要とします。","ko":"복잡한 React 애플리케이션을 구축하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 완벽하게 적합하며, 효율적인 폼 상태 관리와 유효성 검사가 필요합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Frontend que construyen aplicaciones React complejas que necesitan un manejo y validación eficientes de estado de formularios.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui construisent des applications React complexes nécessitant une gestion et une validation efficaces de l''état des formulaires.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die komplexe React-Anwendungen bauen, die effizientes Formularzustandsmanagement und -validierung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que constroem aplicações React complexas que necessitam de gerenciamento de estado de formulário eficiente e validação.","ru":"Идеально подходит для фронтенд-агентов, строящих сложные приложения React, требующие эффективного управления состоянием формы и проверки.","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم البناء التطبيقات React المعقدة التي تحتاج إلى إدارة فعالة لحالة النموذج والتحقق"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle form validation with Yup, manage form state and field values, and implement complex form patterns using React and Formik hooks, optimizing form performance with async submissions.","zh":"使代理能够使用 Yup 处理表单验证、管理表单状态和字段值，并使用 React 和 Formik hooks 实现复杂的表单模式，通过异步提交优化表单性能。","ja":"エージェントが Yup を使用したフォームバリデーションの処理、フォーム状態とフィールド値の管理、React および Formik フックを使用した複雑なフォームパターンの実装を可能にし、非同期送信によるフォームパフォーマンスを最適化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Yup으로 폼 유효성 검사를 처리하고, 폼 상태와 필드 값을 관리하며, React 및 Formik 훅을 사용하여 복잡한 폼 패턴을 구현하고 비동기 제출로 폼 성능을 최적화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar la validación de formularios con Yup, gestionar el estado y los valores de los campos del formulario, e implementar patrones de formularios complejos utilizando ganchos de React y Formik, optimizando el rendimiento del formulario con envíos asíncronos.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer la validation des formulaires avec Yup, de gérer l''état et les valeurs des champs de formulaire, et de mettre en œuvre des modèles de formulaires complexes en utilisant des crochets React et Formik, en optimisant les performances du formulaire avec des soumissions asynchrones.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, die Formularvalidierung mit Yup zu handhaben, den Zustand und die Feldwerte des Formulars zu verwalten und komplexe Formularmuster mit React- und Formik-Hooks zu implementieren, wodurch die Formularleistung mit asynchronen Übermittlungen optimiert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com a validação de formulários com Yup, gerenciar o estado do formulário e os valores dos campos, e implementar padrões de formulários complexos usando React e ganchos Formik, otimizando o desempenho do formulário com envios assíncronos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать проверку форм с помощью Yup, управлять состоянием формы и значениями полей, а также реализовывать сложные шаблоны форм с помощью React и крючков Formik, оптимизируя производительность формы с асинхронными отправками.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التعامل مع التحقق من النماذج باستخدام Yup وإدارة حالة النموذج وقيم الحقول وتطبيق أنماط نموذج معقدة باستخدام React و Hooks Formik وضبط أداء النموذج مع الإرسالات غير المتزامنة"},"useCases":{"en":["Creating dynamic forms with nested objects and arrays","Handling async form submissions with validation","Building custom form components with Formik hooks"],"zh":["创建具有嵌套对象和数组的动态表单","处理带有验证的异步表单提交","使用 Formik hooks 构建自定义表单组件"],"ja":["ネストされたオブジェクトと配列を持つ動的フォームの作成","バリデーションを伴う非同期フォーム送信の処理","Formik フックを使用したカスタムフォームコンポーネントの構築"],"ko":["중첩된 객체와 배열을 갖는 동적 폼 생성","유효성 검사가 포함된 비동기 폼 제출 처리","Formik 훅을 사용한 사용자 정의 폼 컴포넌트 구축"],"es":["Creación de formularios dinámicos con objetos y matrices anidados","Manejo de envíos de formularios asíncronos con validación","Creación de componentes de formulario personalizados con ganchos de Formik"],"fr":["Création de formulaires dynamiques avec des objets et des tableaux imbriqués","Gestion des soumissions de formulaires asynchrones avec validation","Création de composants de formulaire personnalisés avec des crochets Formik"],"de":["Erstellung dynamischer Formulare mit verschachtelten Objekten und Arrays","Handhabung asynchroner Formulareinreichungen mit Validierung","Erstellung benutzerdefinierter Formularkomponenten mit Formik-Hooks"],"pt":["Criar formulários dinâmicos com objetos e matrizes aninhados","Lidar com envios de formulários assíncronos com validação","Construir componentes de formulário personalizados com ganchos Formik"],"ru":["Создание динамических форм с вложенными объектами и массивами","Обработка асинхронных отправок форм с проверкой","Создание пользовательских компонентов форм с помощью крючков Formik"],"ar":["إنشاء نماذج ديناميكية مع كائنات وصفائف مدمجة","التعامل مع إرسالات النماذج غير المتزامنة مع التحقق","بناء مكونات نموذج مخصصة باستخدام Hooks Formik"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires React environment","Limited to form management and validation"],"zh":["需要 React 环境","仅限于表单管理和验证"],"ja":["React 環境が必要","フォーム管理とバリデーションに限定される"],"ko":["React 환경이 필요함","폼 관리 및 유효성 검사로 제한됨"],"es":["Requiere entorno de React","Limitado a la gestión y validación de formularios"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement React","Limité à la gestion et à la validation des formulaires"],"de":["Benötigt React-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Formularverwaltung und -validierung"],"pt":["Requer ambiente React","Limitado ao gerenciamento e validação de formulários"],"ru":["Требуется среда React","Ограничен управлением и проверкой форм"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة React","محدود بإدارة التحقق من النماذج"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9f5fcb8813b8c11042c90110f0e17e0f270e2d7b56df3e63dd3f2fec97a78e6c","qualityScore":70}');
