INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('ksmuvva/Multi-Agent--Council/code-generation', 'code-generation', 'ksmuvva', 'Multi-Agent--Council', 'community', 'code-generation ksmuvva Multi-Agent--Council community The code-generation skill generates production-quality code that is clean, secure, maintainable, and well-tested, benefiting developers and AI agents alike. 代码生成工具可以帮助您创建高质量的代码，具有清晰的命名、单一职责和安全性 コード生成AIエージェントは、クリーンでセキュアなコードを生成するために役立ちます 코드 생성 도구는 깨끗하고 안전한 코드를 생성하여 개발자에게 도움을 줍니다 Geração de código de produção de alta qualidade com clean code, segurança e testes Создание производственного кодирования с чистым кодом, безопасностью и тестированием توليد كود إنتاجي عالي الجودة مع كود نظيف وأمان وتجارب how to use code-generation code-generation best practices code-generation alternative code-generation vs manual coding code-generation setup guide code-generation for AI agents 代码生成工具 AI代码生成 代码质量 安全性优先 DRY原则 自文档代码 代码生成框架 编程语言支持 Generates code with meaningful names and single responsibility functions Applies DRY principle to extract common patterns and reduce repetition Includes comments that explain ''why'' instead of ''what'' for self-documenting code Prioritizes security first with robust and secure coding practices Produces well-tested code with high-quality testing standards Code-generation is the process of creating production-quality code that adheres to clean code principles, security best practices, and maintainability standards.');
