s d''autorisation de composants convexes","de":"Werkzeuge für Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Convex Component Authoring","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Convex Component Authoring","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Convex Component Authoring","en":"convex-component-authoring"},"description":{"zh":"Convex 组件作者是一个多租户组织和团队管理组件，内置 @djpanda/convex-authz 授权","ja":"Convex コンポーネント作成は、マルチテナント組織とチーム管理コンポーネントで、@djpanda/convex-authz を使用した認可が組み込まれています","ko":"Convex 컴포넌트 작성은 멀티 테넌트 조직 및 팀 관리 컴포넌트로 @djpanda/convex-authz를 사용한 인가 기능이 내장되어 있습니다","es":"El componente de autorización de convex-component-authoring es una herramienta para la gestión de equipos y organizaciones multi-tenant en Convex","fr":"Le composant d''autorisation de convex-component-authoring est un outil pour la gestion d''équipes et d''organisations multi-tenant dans Convex","de":"Das Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierungselement ist ein Werkzeug für das multi-tenant-fähige Team- und Organisationsmanagement in Convex","pt":"O Convex Component Authoring é um componente de gerenciamento de equipes e organizações multi-tenant com autorização via @djpanda/convex-authz","ru":"Convex Component Authoring — это компонент управления командами и организациями с поддержкой нескольких арендаторов и встроенной авторизацией через @djpanda/...","ar":"مكون Convex Authoring هو مكون لإدارة الفرق والمنظمات متعدد المستأجرين مع نظام تفويض عبر @djpanda/convex-authz","en":"A multi-tenant organization and team management component for Convex with built-in authorization via @djpanda/convex-authz"},"definition":{"en":"A multi-tenant organization and team management component for Convex with built-in authorization via @djpanda/convex-authz"},"features":{"zh":["多租户组织管理","团队管理功能","内置 @djpanda/convex-authz 授权","Convex 组件支持","高效的开发体验"],"ja":["マルチテナント組織管理","チーム管理機能","内蔵 @djpanda/convex-authz 認可","Convex コンポーネントサポート","効率的な開発体験"],"ko":["멀티 테넌트 조직 관리","팀 관리 기능","내장 @djpanda/convex-authz 인가","Convex 컴포넌트 지원","효율적인 개발 경험"],"es":["Gestión de equipos y organizaciones multi-tenant","Autorización integrada via @djpanda/convex-authz","Compatibilidad con Convex","Diseño de componentes personalizables","Seguridad y autorización avanzadas"],"fr":["Gestion d''équipes et d''organisations multi-tenant","Autorisation intégrée via @djpanda/convex-authz","Compatibilité avec Convex","Conception de composants personnalisables","Sécurité et autorisation avancées"],"de":["Multi-tenant-fähiges Team- und Organisationsmanagement","Integrierte Autorisierung via @djpanda/convex-authz","Kompatibilität mit Convex","Anpassbare Komponenten-Design","Erweiterte Sicherheit und Autorisierung"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de equipes e organizações multi-tenant","Autorização via @djpanda/convex-authz","Integração com Convex","Suporte a múltiplos arrendatários","Segurança e autorização avançadas"],"ru":["Управление командами и организациями с поддержкой нескольких арендаторов","Авторизация через @djpanda/convex-authz","Интеграция с Convex","Поддержка нескольких арендаторов","Продвинутая безопасность и авторизация"],"ar":["نظام إدارة الفرق والمنظمات متعدد المستأجرين","نظام التفويض عبر @djpanda/convex-authz","التكامل مع Convex","دعم متعدد المستأجرين","أمان وتفويض متقدمين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Convex 组件作者","AIエージェント","多租户组织管理","团队管理","Convex 组件","如何使用 Convex","Convex 介绍","Convex 安装","Convex 教程"],"ja":["Convex コンポーネント作成","AIエージェント","マルチテナント組織管理","チーム管理","Convex コンポーネント","Convex の使い方","Convex とは","Convex インストール","Convex チュートリアル"],"ko":["Convex 컴포넌트 작성","AI 에이전트","멀티 테넌트 조직 관리","팀 관리","Convex 컴포넌트","Convex 사용법","Convex 소개","Convex 설치","Convex 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de autorización de componentes convexos","cómo usar convex-component-authoring","qué es convex-component-authoring","convex-component-authoring vs otros componentes","instalación de convex-component-authoring","guía de configuración de convex-component-authoring","desarrollo de componentes convexos","gestión de equipos y organizaciones multi-tenant"],"fr":["outils d''autorisation de composants convexes","comment utiliser convex-component-authoring","qu''est-ce que convex-component-authoring","convex-component-authoring vs autres composants","installation de convex-component-authoring","guide de configuration de convex-component-authoring","développement de composants convexes","gestion d''équipes et d''organisations multi-tenant"],"de":["Werkzeuge für Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung","wie man Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung verwendet","was ist Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung","Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung vs andere Komponenten","Installation von Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung","Konfigurationsanleitung für Convex-Komponenten-Autorisierung","Entwicklung von Convex-Komponenten","multi-tenant-fähiges Team- und Organisationsmanagement"],"pt":["como usar Convex Component Authoring","o que é Convex","alternativas ao Convex","Convex vs outros componentes","instalar Convex Component Authoring","guia de configuração do Convex","desenvolvimento de componentes Convex","gerenciamento de equipes e organizações","autorização e segurança em Convex"],"ru":["как использовать Convex Component Authoring","что такое Convex","альтернативы Convex","Convex vs другие компоненты","установка Convex Component Authoring","руководство по настройке Convex","разработка компонентов Convex","управление командами и организациями","авторизация и безопасность в Convex"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام مكون Convex Authoring","ما هو مكون Convex","بديلات مكون Convex","مكون Convex مقابل مكونات أخرى","تثبيت مكون Convex Authoring","دليل إعداد مكون Convex","تطوير مكونات Convex","نظام إدارة الفرق والمنظمات","نظام التفويض والأمان في Convex"]}},"owner":"dbjpanda","repo":"convex-tenants","repoPath":"dbjpanda/convex-tenants","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-05T06:20:06.259Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"convex-component-authoring","description":"How to create, structure, and publish self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management","version":"1.0.0","tags":["convex","components","reusable","packages","npm"],"bodyPreview":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex component","body":"# Convex Component Authoring\n\nCreate self-contained, reusable Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management for sharing across projects.\n\n## Documentation Sources\n\nBefore implementing, do not assume; fetch the latest documentation:\n\n- Primary: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n- For broader context: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n\n## Instructions\n\n### What Are Convex Components?\n\nConvex components are self-contained packages that include:\n- Database tables (isolated from the main app)\n- Functions (queries, mutations, actions)\n- TypeScript types and validators\n- Optional frontend hooks\n\n### Component Structure\n\n```\nmy-convex-component/\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── README.md\n├── src/\n│   ├── index.ts           # Main exports\n│   ├── component.ts       # Component definition\n│   ├── schema.ts          # Component schema\n│   └── functions/\n│       ├── queries.ts\n│       ├── mutations.ts\n│       └── actions.ts\n└── convex.config.ts       # Component configuration\n```\n\n### Creating a Component\n\n#### 1. Component Configuration\n\n```typescript\n// convex.config.ts\nimport { defineComponent } from \"convex/server\";\n\nexport default defineComponent(\"myComponent\");\n```\n\n#### 2. Component Schema\n\n```typescript\n// src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  // Tables are isolated to this component\n  items: defineTable({\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  }).index(\"by_name\", [\"name\"]),\n  \n  config: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    value: v.any(),\n  }).index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"]),\n});\n```\n\n#### 3. Component Definition\n\n```typescript\n// src/component.ts\nimport { defineComponent, ComponentDefinition } from \"convex/server\";\nimport schema from \"./schema\";\nimport * as queries from \"./functions/queries\";\nimport * as mutations from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\nconst component = defineComponent(\"myComponent\", {\n  schema,\n  functions: {\n    ...queries,\n    ...mutations,\n  },\n});\n\nexport default component;\n```\n\n#### 4. Component Functions\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/queries.ts\nimport { query } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const list = query({\n  args: {\n    limit: v.optional(v.number()),\n  },\n  returns: v.array(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n    createdAt: v.number(),\n  })),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .order(\"desc\")\n      .take(args.limit ?? 10);\n  },\n});\n\nexport const get = query({\n  args: { name: v.string() },\n  returns: v.union(v.object({\n    _id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  }), v.null()),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db\n      .query(\"items\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_name\", (q) => q.eq(\"name\", args.name))\n      .unique();\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const create = mutation({\n  args: {\n    name: v.string(),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.id(\"items\"),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    return await ctx.db.insert(\"items\", {\n      name: args.name,\n      data: args.data,\n      createdAt: Date.now(),\n    });\n  },\n});\n\nexport const update = mutation({\n  args: {\n    id: v.id(\"items\"),\n    data: v.any(),\n  },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.patch(args.id, { data: args.data });\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n\nexport const remove = mutation({\n  args: { id: v.id(\"items\") },\n  returns: v.null(),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    await ctx.db.delete(args.id);\n    return null;\n  },\n});\n```\n\n#### 5. Main Exports\n\n```typescript\n// src/index.ts\nexport { default as component } from \"./component\";\nexport * from \"./functions/queries\";\nexport * from \"./functions/mutations\";\n\n// Export types for consumers\nexport type { Id } from \"./_generated/dataModel\";\n```\n\n### Using a Component\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"myComponent\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n```typescript\n// In the consuming app''s code\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction MyApp() {\n  // Access component functions through the app''s API\n  const items = useQuery(api.myComponent.list, { limit: 10 });\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.myComponent.create);\n  \n  return (\n    <div>\n      {items?.map((item) => (\n        <div key={item._id}>{item.name}</div>\n      ))}\n      <button onClick={() => createItem({ name: \"New\", data: {} })}>\n        Add Item\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Component Configuration Options\n\n```typescript\n// convex/convex.config.ts\nimport { defineApp } from \"convex/server\";\nimport myComponent from \"my-convex-component\";\n\nconst app = defineApp();\n\n// Basic usage\napp.use(myComponent);\n\n// With custom name\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"customName\" });\n\n// Multiple instances\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance1\" });\napp.use(myComponent, { name: \"instance2\" });\n\nexport default app;\n```\n\n### Providing Component Hooks\n\n```typescript\n// src/hooks.ts\nimport { useQuery, useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { FunctionReference } from \"convex/server\";\n\n// Type-safe hooks for component consumers\nexport function useMyComponent(api: {\n  list: FunctionReference<\"query\">;\n  create: FunctionReference<\"mutation\">;\n}) {\n  const items = useQuery(api.list, {});\n  const createItem = useMutation(api.create);\n  \n  return {\n    items,\n    createItem,\n    isLoading: items === undefined,\n  };\n}\n```\n\n### Publishing a Component\n\n#### package.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-convex-component\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"description\": \"A reusable Convex component\",\n  \"main\": \"dist/index.js\",\n  \"types\": \"dist/index.d.ts\",\n  \"files\": [\n    \"dist\",\n    \"convex.config.ts\"\n  ],\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"build\": \"tsc\",\n    \"prepublishOnly\": \"npm run build\"\n  },\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"convex\": \"^1.17.0\",\n    \"typescript\": \"^5.0.0\"\n  },\n  \"keywords\": [\n    \"convex\",\n    \"component\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n#### tsconfig.json\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n    \"module\": \"ESNext\",\n    \"moduleResolution\": \"bundler\",\n    \"declaration\": true,\n    \"outDir\": \"dist\",\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"esModuleInterop\": true,\n    \"skipLibCheck\": true\n  },\n  \"include\": [\"src/**/*\"],\n  \"exclude\": [\"node_modules\", \"dist\"]\n}\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Rate Limiter Component\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/schema.ts\nimport { defineSchema, defineTable } from \"convex/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport default defineSchema({\n  requests: defineTable({\n    key: v.string(),\n    timestamp: v.number(),\n  })\n    .index(\"by_key\", [\"key\"])\n    .index(\"by_key_and_time\", [\"key\", \"timestamp\"]),\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// rate-limiter/src/functions/mutations.ts\nimport { mutation } from \"../_generated/server\";\nimport { v } from \"convex/values\";\n\nexport const checkLimit = mutation({\n  args: {\n    key: v.string(),\n    limit: v.number(),\n    windowMs: v.number(),\n  },\n  returns: v.object({\n    allowed: v.boolean(),\n    remaining: v.number(),\n    resetAt: v.number(),\n  }),\n  handler: async (ctx, args) => {\n    const now = Date.now();\n    const windowStart = now - args.windowMs;\n    \n    // Clean old entries\n    const oldEntries = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key_and_time\", (q) => \n        q.eq(\"key\", args.key).lt(\"timestamp\", windowStart)\n      )\n      .collect();\n    \n    for (const entry of oldEntries) {\n      await ctx.db.delete(entry._id);\n    }\n    \n    // Count current window\n    const currentRequests = await ctx.db\n      .query(\"requests\")\n      .withIndex(\"by_key\", (q) => q.eq(\"key\", args.key))\n      .collect();\n    \n    const remaining = Math.max(0, args.limit - currentRequests.length);\n    const allowed = remaining > 0;\n    \n    if (allowed) {\n      await ctx.db.insert(\"requests\", {\n        key: args.key,\n        timestamp: now,\n      });\n    }\n    \n    const oldestRequest = currentRequests[0];\n    const resetAt = oldestRequest \n      ? oldestRequest.timestamp + args.windowMs \n      : now + args.windowMs;\n    \n    return { allowed, remaining: remaining - (allowed ? 1 : 0), resetAt };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n```typescript\n// Usage in consuming app\nimport { useMutation } from \"convex/react\";\nimport { api } from \"../convex/_generated/api\";\n\nfunction useRateLimitedAction() {\n  const checkLimit = useMutation(api.rateLimiter.checkLimit);\n  \n  return async (action: () => Promise<void>) => {\n    const result = await checkLimit({\n      key: \"user-action\",\n      limit: 10,\n      windowMs: 60000,\n    });\n    \n    if (!result.allowed) {\n      throw new Error(`Rate limited. Try again at ${new Date(result.resetAt)}`);\n    }\n    \n    await action();\n  };\n}\n```\n\n## Best Practices\n\n- Never run `npx convex deploy` unless explicitly instructed\n- Never run any git commands unless explicitly instructed\n- Keep component tables isolated (don''t reference main app tables)\n- Export clear TypeScript types for consumers\n- Document all public functions and their arguments\n- Use semantic versioning for component releases\n- Include comprehensive README with examples\n- Test components in isolation before publishing\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n1. **Cross-referencing tables** - Component tables should be self-contained\n2. **Missing type exports** - Export all necessary types\n3. **Hardcoded configuration** - Use component options for customization\n4. **No versioning** - Follow semantic versioning\n5. **Poor documentation** - Document all public APIs\n\n## References\n\n- Convex Documentation: https://docs.convex.dev/\n- Convex LLMs.txt: https://docs.convex.dev/llms.txt\n- Components: https://docs.convex.dev/components\n- Component Authoring: https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-05T07:51:34.939Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Full Stack Agents needing reusable Convex components with built-in authorization via @djpanda/convex-authz","zh":"适用于需要可重用 Convex 组件并通过 @djpanda/convex-authz 进行内置授权的全栈代理","ja":"再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントと@djpanda/convex-authzによる組み込み認可を必要とするフルスタックエージェントに適しています","ko":"@djpanda/convex-authz를 통해 내장된 인증을 갖춘 재사용 가능한 Convex 컴포넌트가 필요한 풀 스택 에이전트에게 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Full Stack que necesitan componentes Convex reutilizables con autorización integrada a través de @djpanda/convex-authz","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Full Stack ayant besoin de composants Convex réutilisables avec une autorisation intégrée via @djpanda/convex-authz","de":"Perfekt für Full-Stack-Agents, die wiederverwendbare Convex-Komponenten mit integrierter Autorisierung über @djpanda/convex-authz benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Full Stack que precisam de componentes Convex reutilizáveis com autorização embutida via @djpanda/convex-authz","ru":"Идеально подходит для Full Stack агентов, которым необходимы повторно используемые компоненты Convex с встроенной авторизацией через @djpanda/convex-authz","ar":"مثالي لعميل متراكب الكامل الذي يحتاج إلى مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام مع المصادقة المدمجة عبر @djpanda/convex-authz"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create self-contained Convex components with proper isolation, exports, and dependency management, utilizing @djpanda/convex-authz for authorization and following Convex component authoring guidelines from https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","zh":"赋予代理创建自包含的Convex组件的能力，具有适当的隔离、导出和依赖管理，利用@djpanda/convex-authz进行授权，并遵循Convex组件作者指南 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","ja":"@djpanda/convex-authzを使用した認可と、https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoringからのConvexコンポーネント著者ガイドラインに従うことで、適切な分離、エクスポート、依存関係管理を使用して、セルフコンテイナConvexコンポーネントを作成するエージェントを可能にします","ko":"適절한 분리, 내보내기 및 의존성 관리를 사용하여 자체 포함 Convex 구성 요소를 만들 수 있는 에이전트를 활성화하고 @djpanda/convex-authz를 사용하여 인증을 수행하고 https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring의 Convex 구성 요소 작성 지침을 따릅니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes Convex autocontenidos con aislamiento adecuado, exportaciones y gestión de dependencias, utilizando @djpanda/convex-authz para la autorización y siguiendo las guías de autoría de componentes Convex desde https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants Convex autocontenus avec une isolation appropriée, des exportations et une gestion des dépendances, en utilisant @djpanda/convex-authz pour l''autorisation et en suivant les directives d''écriture de composants Convex à partir de https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, selbstenthaltene Convex-Komponenten mit ordnungsgemäßer Isolation, Exporten und Abhängigkeitsverwaltung zu erstellen, indem @djpanda/convex-authz für die Autorisierung verwendet wird und den Convex-Komponenten-Autorenrichtlinien von https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring gefolgt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes Convex autocontidos com isolamento adequado, exportações e gerenciamento de dependências, utilizando @djpanda/convex-authz para autorização e seguindo as diretrizes de criação de componentes Convex de https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать самодостаточные компоненты Convex с правильной изоляцией, экспортами и управлением зависимостями, используя @djpanda/convex-authz для авторизации и следуя рекомендациям по созданию компонентов Convex из https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring","ar":"يسمح للعملاء بإنشاء مكونات Convex محكمة مع عزل مناسب وتحويلات وإدارة التبعيات، باستخدام @djpanda/convex-authz للمصادقة اتباعًا لدليل كتابة مكونات Convex من https://docs.convex.dev/components/authoring"},"useCases":{"en":["Authoring reusable Convex components for multi-tenant organizations","Implementing authorization via @djpanda/convex-authz in Convex components","Managing dependencies and exports for Convex components"],"zh":["为多租户组织编写可重用的Convex组件","在Convex组件中通过@djpanda/convex-authz实现授权","管理Convex组件的依赖项和导出"],"ja":["マルチテナント組織の再利用可能なConvexコンポーネントの作成","Convexコンポーネントで@djpanda/convex-authzを使用した認可の実装","Convexコンポーネントの依存関係とエクスポートの管理"],"ko":["다중 임대자 조직을 위한 재사용 가능한 Convex 구성 요소 작성","@djpanda/convex-authz를 사용하여 Convex 구성 요소에서 인증을 구현","Convex 구성 요소의 종속성 및 내보내기 관리"],"es":["Creación de componentes Convex reutilizables para organizaciones multi-inquilino","Implementación de autorización a través de @djpanda/convex-authz en componentes Convex","Gestión de dependencias y exportaciones para componentes Convex"],"fr":["Création de composants Convex réutilisables pour les organisations multi-locataires","Mise en œuvre de l''autorisation via @djpanda/convex-authz dans les composants Convex","Gestion des dépendances et des exportations pour les composants Convex"],"de":["Erstellung wiederverwendbarer Convex-Komponenten für Multi-Tenant-Organisationen","Implementierung der Autorisierung über @djpanda/convex-authz in Convex-Komponenten","Verwaltung von Abhängigkeiten und Exporten für Convex-Komponenten"],"pt":["Criação de componentes Convex reutilizáveis para organizações multi-locatárias","Implementação de autorização via @djpanda/convex-authz em componentes Convex","Gerenciamento de dependências e exportações para componentes Convex"],"ru":["Создание повторно используемых компонентов Convex для многопользовательских организаций","Реализация авторизации через @djpanda/convex-authz в компонентах Convex","Управление зависимостями и экспортами для компонентов Convex"],"ar":["إنشاء مكونات Convex قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام لمنظمات متعددة المستأجرين","تنفيذ المصادقة عبر @djpanda/convex-authz في مكونات Convex","إدارة التبعيات والتحويلات لمكونات Convex"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Convex environment","Dependent on @djpanda/convex-authz library for authorization"],"zh":["需要Convex环境","依赖@djpanda/convex-authz库进行授权"],"ja":["Convex環境が必要","認可には@djpanda/convex-authzライブラリに依存"],"ko":["Convex 환경 필요","@djpanda/convex-authz 라이브러리에 의존하는 인증"],"es":["Requiere entorno Convex","Dependiente de la biblioteca @djpanda/convex-authz para la autorización"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement Convex","Dépend de la bibliothèque @djpanda/convex-authz pour l''autorisation"],"de":["Benötigt Convex-Umgebung","Abhängig von der Bibliothek @djpanda/convex-authz für die Autorisierung"],"pt":["Exige ambiente Convex","Dependente da biblioteca @djpanda/convex-authz para autorização"],"ru":["Требует среды Convex","Зависит от библиотеки @djpanda/convex-authz для авторизации"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة Convex","يعتمد على مكتبة @djpanda/convex-authz للمصادقة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"561346aded0969635fc3f32ae6d465f882266b6be20b4038c7a55645ff6db7c2","qualityScore":70}');
